msgstr "Cool. Bon ben..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Thanks, I guess."
msgstr "Merci, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/0/s/0 cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it?"
msgstr "C'est tout ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're welcome, I guess."
msgstr "De rien, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look, I'm not a big small-talker."
msgstr "Écoute, je suis pas un grand fan des bavardages."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you've got some more good trash, let's do some business but other than that..."
msgstr "Si t'as encore des bonnes ordures, on fait affaire, mais à part ça..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I get it. You just don't know what to say."
msgstr "Oh, je vois. Tu ne sais juste pas quoi dire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Business."
msgstr "Les affaires."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh."
msgstr "Pff."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sure. Whatever you have to tell yourself."
msgstr "C'est ça. Raconte-toi ce que tu veux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Making conversation is a lot easier than wading through this disgusting shit all day."
msgstr "Faire la conversation, c'est bien plus facile que de patauger toute la journée dans cette merde dégoûtante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What, you need a dictionary now?"
msgstr "Quoi, il te faut un dictionnaire, maintenant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-1/15/g-0/16/g-0/8/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean trading useless trash. Not even trading, I just give it to you."
msgstr "Tu veux dire échanger des ordures inutiles. Même pas échanger, je te les donne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Creative. I find dryer lint is wicked absorbent, so good on you."
msgstr "Créatif. Je trouve que la peluche de sèche-linge est super absorbante, alors bravo."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Work with what ya got."
msgstr "Faut faire avec ce qu'on a."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...I was kidding. I don't think that's actually sanitary."
msgstr "... Je plaisantais. Je ne pense pas que ce soit très hygiénique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess it is creative, huh? Good for me."
msgstr "C'est créatif, en effet, hein ? Bravo à moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, either way. Most things in your house are pretty grody anyway."
msgstr "Bah, dans les deux cas. La plupart des trucs de ta maison sont assez crados de toute façon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que c'est censé vouloir dire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think you're in a position to judge cleanliness...?"
msgstr "Je ne crois pas que tu sois bien placé pour juger de la propreté... ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nothing personal. People are obsessed with \"clean\" these days and it's kind of a myth."
msgstr "Rien de personnel. Les gens sont obsédés par le « propre » de nos jours, et c'est un peu un mythe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "There's dirt and microbes and grime on everything. It's pretty normal."
msgstr "Y a de la poussière, des microbes et de la crasse sur tout. C'est plutôt normal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "People got scared that somehow all that stuff was bad for you and, really, that's why you have an immune system."
msgstr "Les gens se sont mis à flipper que tous ces trucs soient mauvais pour toi, alors que bon, c'est pour ça que t'as un système immunitaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess that's why you're so healthy, huh?"
msgstr "J'imagine que c'est pour ça que tu es en si bonne santé, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well first of all I don't have an immune system."
msgstr "Ben d'abord, j'ai pas de système immunitaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/20
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "My cleanest day is when you decide to whip out those Clor-Box wipes and scrub up that berry smoothie crud you dripped on me back in February."
msgstr "Mon jour le plus propre, c'est quand tu décides de sortir tes lingettes Clor-Box pour récurer la croûte de smoothie aux fruits rouges que t'as fait couler sur moi en février."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/28
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But secondly, yeah. I'm a pretty healthy receptacle. Can eat whatever I want, drink whatever I want."
msgstr "Mais ensuite, ouais. Je suis un réceptacle en plutôt bonne santé. Je peux manger ce que je veux, boire ce que je veux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/36
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "Ça me va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/44/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lucky you. If I was surrounded by all this crap, I'd be sick all the time."
msgstr "Veinard. Si j'étais {{entouré|entourée|entouré·e}} de toute cette merde, je serais malade tout le temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...yeah. Cool, 'cuz I definitely meant it as a personal compliment."
msgstr "... ouais. Cool, parce que je le pensais clairement comme un compliment personnel."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't?"
msgstr "Ce n'était pas le cas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate it."
msgstr "Merci, c'est gentil."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess it's good to see compliments in comments. Probably makes socializing easier."
msgstr "J'imagine que c'est bien de voir des compliments dans les commentaires. Ça doit rendre les rapports sociaux plus faciles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like you don't find socializing easy."
msgstr "On dirait que les rapports sociaux, ce n'est pas facile pour toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh for sure. I never notice when people mock me."
msgstr "Oh, carrément. Je ne remarque jamais quand les gens se moquent de moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, not really. People think it's weird when you're thanking them for things they didn't mean to say."
msgstr "Non, pas vraiment. Les gens trouvent bizarre qu'on les remercie pour des choses qu'ils ne voulaient pas dire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess I don't."
msgstr "J'imagine que non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Which is fine. I don't really like anybody anyway. So it works out."
msgstr "Ce qui est très bien. J'aime personne, de toute façon. Alors ça tombe bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you want to talk about it?"
msgstr "Tu veux en parler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you'd like them more if you thought they liked you."
msgstr "Tu les aimerais peut-être plus si tu pensais qu'ils t'aiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Aaaand we've strayed into psychobabble territory. Time for a course correction."
msgstr "Eeeet nous voilà en territoire psycho-blabla. Changement de cap."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm just saying that maybe if you had a better opinion of yourself, you'd see others differently."
msgstr "Non, je dis juste que si tu avais une meilleure opinion de toi-même, tu verrais peut-être les autres autrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Psychobabble can actually be really helpful."
msgstr "Le psycho-blabla peut vraiment aider, en fait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "My opinion of myself is dandy."
msgstr "Mon opinion de moi-même est au top."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/0/s/0 cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Vraiment ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn't look like it to me."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas l'impression que ça me donne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yup, pretty sure I'm doin' just fine."
msgstr "Ouaip, je suis à peu près sûr que je m'en sors très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sounds to me like you're the one that has a problem with me."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression que c'est plutôt toi qui as un problème avec moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well... you are kinda grimy."
msgstr "Bah... t'es un peu crasseux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's called projection. And no, it's not what I'm doing."
msgstr "Ça s'appelle de la projection. Et non, ce n'est pas ce que je fais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Grimy. Wow. Maybe if I lathered up with some vanilla scented bodywash I'd think I had more value."
msgstr "Crasseux. Ouah. Si je me tartinais de gel douche à la vanille, je me trouverais peut-être plus de valeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, maybe! What if you got rid of some of this old trash?"
msgstr "Enfin, peut-être ! Et si tu te débarrassais de quelques-unes de ces vieilles ordures ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Vanilla might work, I dunno. Just something other than \"eau du garbage,\" honestly."
msgstr "La vanille, pourquoi pas, j'en sais rien. N'importe quoi d'autre que « eau de poubelle », franchement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Psychobabble 2.0, folks."
msgstr "Psycho-blabla 2.0, mesdames et messieurs."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Y'know what, I think we're done for today."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi, je crois qu'on a fini pour aujourd'hui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right. So I can't offer you valuable conversation, but physical waste dumped on you everyday is fine."
msgstr "D'accord. Donc je ne peux pas t'offrir une conversation qui a de la valeur, mais des déchets physiques balancés sur toi tous les jours, ça va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, no problem. I get it. I'll come back another time and bring some more cast-offs for the pile."
msgstr "OK, pas de problème. Je comprends. Je reviendrai une autre fois avec d'autres rebuts pour la pile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hey whatever works for you. I'm just not interested."
msgstr "Hé, comme tu veux. Ça m'intéresse juste pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I also feel like I've said this already."
msgstr "Et j'ai aussi l'impression de l'avoir déjà dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Buzz off with the \"help Cam\" bullshit."
msgstr "Lâche-moi avec tes conneries de « aider Cam »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow you're aggressive."
msgstr "Ouah, t'es agressif."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pushing me away. Classic."
msgstr "Tu me repousses. Classique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh for the love of... that's it."
msgstr "Oh, pour l'amour de... ça suffit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/31/g-0/11
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I've had enough. Leave me alone and take your \"where does it hurt, honey\" with you."
msgstr "J'en ai assez. Fiche-moi la paix et remballe ton « où est-ce que t'as mal, mon chou »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/31/g-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine. I'll go and you can go back to hiding in your piles of shit."
msgstr "Très bien. Je m'en vais, et tu peux retourner te cacher dans tes tas de merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-0/23/g-0/8/c-1/31/g-0/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, like you're really gonna be able to heal by yourself, surrounded by all this smelly trash!"
msgstr "Ouais, comme si t'allais pouvoir guérir tout seul, au milieu de toutes ces ordures qui puent !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...if you never notice it, how do you know that people are mocking you..."
msgstr "... si tu le remarques jamais, comment tu sais que les gens se moquent de toi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good point. Shit."
msgstr "Bien vu. Merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "People tell me about it, after."
msgstr "Les gens me le disent, après."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So maybe your system isn't working so well, after all."
msgstr "Alors ton système marche peut-être pas si bien que ça, finalement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "Peut-être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not like yours is better. Life-building via self-isolation and crap-hoarding."
msgstr "Pas comme si le tien était mieux. Construire sa vie en s'isolant et en accumulant de la merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hey, don't sweat it. You can always do something different, right?"
msgstr "Hé, t'en fais pas. Tu peux toujours faire les choses autrement, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "J'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How do you do it? Not care what people think?"
msgstr "Comment tu fais ? Pour te ficher de ce que les gens pensent ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I just do what I want."
msgstr "Je fais juste ce que je veux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If people don't like it, don't like me, that's on them."
msgstr "Si les gens aiment pas ça, ou m'aiment pas, c'est leur problème."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Their opinions have nothing to do with me."
msgstr "Leurs opinions ont rien à voir avec moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's amazing you can think like that with all this useless junk all around you."
msgstr "C'est incroyable que tu arrives à penser comme ça avec toutes ces cochonneries inutiles autour de toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're really smart."
msgstr "Tu es vraiment intelligent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...thanks."
msgstr "... merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't have expected that from someone practically dressed in trash and old waste."
msgstr "Je ne m'y serais pas attendu{{|e|·e}} de la part de quelqu'un pratiquement habillé d'ordures et de vieux déchets."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...ah. That's... weird."
msgstr "... ah. C'est... bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think maybe you need to hang out with better people."
msgstr "Tu devrais peut-être traîner avec des gens mieux que ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe. But making new friends is kind of a pain in the ass."
msgstr "Peut-être. Mais se faire de nouveaux amis, c'est un peu chiant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, they're ok. I'm sure I'm not a prize all the time either."
msgstr "Bah, ils sont pas si mal. Je suis sûr{{|e|·e}} que je ne suis pas un cadeau non plus, tout le temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ha. Yeah, I hear ya."
msgstr "Ha. Ouais, je vois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I kinda stopped trying."
msgstr "J'ai un peu arrêté d'essayer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have the friends I have, and I'm not really looking for any new hassles."
msgstr "J'ai les amis que j'ai, et je cherche pas vraiment de nouvelles galères."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly. Hey, maybe this could work."
msgstr "Exactement. Hé, ça pourrait peut-être marcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This?"
msgstr "Quoi, ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This. Us. Being friends."
msgstr "Ça. Nous. Être amis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pump the brakes, Rail Earnhardt."
msgstr "Freine un peu, Ayrton Benne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just because I don't want to fwap you with an old carrot doesn't mean we're gonna go fishing or anything."
msgstr "C'est pas parce que j'ai pas envie de te fouetter avec une vieille carotte qu'on va aller à la pêche ensemble ou un truc du genre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What creative imagery you use, Cam."
msgstr "Quelles images créatives, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, it could be really fun!"
msgstr "Non, ça pourrait être super sympa !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh no. You're not gonna let this go, are you."
msgstr "Oh non. Tu vas pas lâcher l'affaire, hein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/23/g-0/11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go find some trash to collect and compare notes on the kinds of shit we like the best!"
msgstr "Allons chercher des ordures à collectionner et comparer nos notes sur nos saletés préférées !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Fair. But nobody is. There's no such thing as someone who's always nice and fun to be around."
msgstr "C'est vrai. Mais personne l'est. Ça existe pas, quelqu'un qui est toujours gentil et agréable à côtoyer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That person is a myth. A standard used to make other folks feel like shit about themselves."
msgstr "Cette personne est un mythe. Un modèle qu'on utilise pour que les autres se sentent comme de la merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And it works, which is the really shitty thing about it."
msgstr "Et ça marche, et c'est ça le plus merdique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha. I guess so."
msgstr "Ha. J'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're saying it's ok to be a butthead sometimes?"
msgstr "Donc tu dis que c'est OK d'être un abruti de temps en temps ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Be a butthead."
msgstr "Sois un abruti."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not all the time. I guess. But some of the time."
msgstr "Pas tout le temps. J'imagine. Mais de temps en temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think it's healthy."
msgstr "Je pense que c'est sain."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And since I assume you're gonna ask me this, no."
msgstr "Et comme je suppose que tu vas me poser la question : non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Your \"friends\" explaining to you after the fact that they're mocking you?"
msgstr "Tes « amis » qui t'expliquent après coup qu'ils se moquaient de toi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's not healthy butthead behavior."
msgstr "C'est pas un comportement d'abruti sain."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/48
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's just plain ol', straight up, dickish nonsense."
msgstr "C'est juste des conneries de connards, purement et simplement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/56
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Rejected."
msgstr "Recalé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha. I like you, Cam."
msgstr "Ha. Je t'aime bien, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. Rejected. New catch-phrase."
msgstr "Haha. Recalé. Nouvelle réplique culte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...huh?"
msgstr "... hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you. In spite of all this crap you surround yourself with."
msgstr "Je t'aime bien. Malgré toute cette merde dont tu t'entoures."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Horrific smell aside, you're fun to be with."
msgstr "Odeur atroce mise à part, c'est sympa d'être avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Use it in good health."
msgstr "Sers-t'en avec modération."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I see how you've gotten so good at not needing people."
msgstr "Je crois que je vois comment tu es devenu si doué pour ne pas avoir besoin des autres."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get more of why you live this way now."
msgstr "Je comprends mieux pourquoi tu vis comme ça, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh really?"
msgstr "Ah ouais ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/64/c-1/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Collecting all this junk, it's a way of showing people you're not afraid to be a butthead."
msgstr "Collectionner toutes ces cochonneries, c'est une façon de montrer aux gens que tu n'as pas peur d'être un abruti."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, I can see that."
msgstr "Ouais, ça se tient."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But so what if people think you're weird?"
msgstr "Mais qu'est-ce que ça peut faire, si les gens te trouvent bizarre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a lot easier to make friends if people don't think you're weird."
msgstr "C'est beaucoup plus facile de se faire des amis si les gens ne te trouvent pas bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know it shouldn't matter. But it kinda does."
msgstr "Je sais que ça ne devrait pas compter. Mais un peu quand même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guarantee you these people are just as weird as you are."
msgstr "Je te garantis que ces gens sont aussi bizarres que toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Everyone's weird. That's the big secret of life, right there."
msgstr "Tout le monde est bizarre. C'est ça, le grand secret de la vie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "There's no such thing as normal and anyone who tells you they're \"normal\" is blowing a whole lot of smoke up someone's ass."
msgstr "Le normal, ça existe pas, et quiconque te dit qu'il est « normal » te raconte des salades."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that why you collect all this shit? It's your way of being weird?"
msgstr "C'est pour ça que tu collectionnes toute cette merde ? C'est ta façon d'être bizarre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess if you literally wear your weird on your sleeve, it's easier."
msgstr "J'imagine que si tu affiches littéralement ta bizarrerie sur toi, c'est plus facile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-2/19/c-2/23/c-1/15/g-0/8/c-2/23/g-0/24/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, so much crap around you... pretty effectively advertises that you don't care about \"normal.\""
msgstr "Je veux dire, toute cette merde autour de toi... c'est une pub plutôt efficace pour dire que tu te fiches d'être « normal »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/11
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Very promising. Gimme some details."
msgstr "Très prometteur. Donne-moi des détails."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was in my underwear drawer."
msgstr "C'était dans mon tiroir à sous-vêtements."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm afraid to smell it, but that feels like the next logical step."
msgstr "J'ai peur de le sentir, mais j'ai l'impression que c'est l'étape logique suivante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't wanna."
msgstr "J'ai pas envie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/7 cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr "Excellent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Was it moving when you found it?"
msgstr "Il bougeait, quand tu l'as trouvé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, god!"
msgstr "Oh, mon dieu !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, it wasn't moving... what's wrong with you?"
msgstr "Non, il ne bougeait pas... qu'est-ce qui ne va pas chez toi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just checking. Details matter, bucko."
msgstr "Je vérifie, c'est tout. Les détails comptent, mon pote."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Also, you didn't answer my question."
msgstr "Et t'as pas répondu à ma question."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Cool. Well, the first step is to kill it. I don't keep pets."
msgstr "Cool. Bon, la première étape, c'est de le tuer. J'ai pas d'animaux de compagnie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So, you killed it, right?"
msgstr "Donc, tu l'as tué, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I killed it, that's why it was sticky. I'm fearsome."
msgstr "Ouais, je l'ai tué, c'est pour ça qu'il est collant. Je suis redoutable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I... closed the drawer and waited for it to die."
msgstr "Non, je... j'ai fermé le tiroir et j'ai attendu qu'il meure."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sure you are."
msgstr "C'est ça, ouais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, give it here and we can conclude our business for the day."
msgstr "Bon, file-le-moi et on peut conclure nos affaires du jour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda thought we'd have more conversation about this..."
msgstr "Je pensais un peu qu'on en discuterait davantage..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not a huge fan of small talk."
msgstr "Je suis pas un grand fan des bavardages."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Or large talk."
msgstr "Ni des grands discours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Conversation in general isn't really my thing so..."
msgstr "La conversation en général, c'est pas trop mon truc, alors..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Don't really know what you want from me here."
msgstr "Je vois pas trop ce que t'attends de moi, là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotta love a can who gets to the point."
msgstr "J'adore les poubelles qui vont droit au but."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seriously just accept a dead body from me and we're done talking."
msgstr "Sérieusement, tu acceptes un cadavre de ma part, et c'est fini, on ne parle plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yup, that's me."
msgstr "Ouaip, c'est moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, tell me about yourself!"
msgstr "Allez, parle-moi de toi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You want my biography?"
msgstr "Tu veux ma biographie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hi, I'm Cam. I'm a trash can, I don't like talking to people, you're starting to get on my nerves, and, since we're bonding..."
msgstr "Salut, moi c'est Cam. Je suis une poubelle, j'aime pas parler aux gens, tu commences à me taper sur les nerfs, et, puisqu'on fait connaissance..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I slept like shit last night because \"someone\" tossed a half full can of fizzy water in here and I had bubbles tickling my ass until 2am."
msgstr "J'ai dormi comme une merde cette nuit parce que « quelqu'un » a balancé une canette d'eau gazeuse à moitié pleine ici et que des bulles m'ont chatouillé le cul jusqu'à 2 h du matin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...yeah, that was me."
msgstr "... ouais, c'était moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tee hee. Tickly bubbles."
msgstr "Hi hi. Les bulles qui chatouillent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Gee, really?"
msgstr "Sans blague ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry. I thought all trash was trash."
msgstr "Pardon. Je croyais qu'un déchet, c'était un déchet."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh, now you're a comedian."
msgstr "Oh, maintenant tu fais l'humoriste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, come on. You can't really take all this crap seriously."
msgstr "Oh, allez. Tu ne peux pas vraiment prendre toutes ces saletés au sérieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might as well have given you the butt end of a bunch of celery."
msgstr "J'aurais aussi bien pu te donner le trognon d'une botte de céleri."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That would've worked fine, too."
msgstr "Ça aurait très bien marché aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Celery is actually great. Very sturdy."
msgstr "Le céleri, c'est génial, en fait. Très solide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you at least tell me what you're going to do with... it?"
msgstr "Tu peux au moins me dire ce que tu vas faire de... ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not sure yet. Something brilliant will come to me, I'm sure."
msgstr "Je sais pas encore. Une idée géniale va me venir, j'en suis sûr."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, gross. You're just gonna let it sit around with the rest of this junk?"
msgstr "Oh, dégueu. Tu vas juste le laisser traîner avec le reste de ces cochonneries ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-0/23/g-0/32/c-1/7/c-0/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like it. You do seem to have a lot of waste-based talents."
msgstr "On dirait. Tu as l'air d'avoir plein de talents liés aux déchets."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Also an option."
msgstr "C'est aussi une option."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'll bet putting on underwear for the past few days has been challenging."
msgstr "Je parie que mettre des sous-vêtements, ces derniers jours, ça a été compliqué."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It has."
msgstr "Ça l'a été."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... I've been skipping that step, actually."
msgstr "Ouais... en fait, je saute cette étape."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wow, but you did it."
msgstr "Ouah, mais tu l'as fait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I probably would've just gone commando."
msgstr "Moi, je serais sûrement juste sorti sans rien en dessous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I actually generally just go commando."
msgstr "En fait, en général, je mets rien en dessous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I could look for clean underwear everyday but, meh."
msgstr "Je pourrais chercher des sous-vêtements propres tous les jours, mais bof."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're telling me that in all this crap, you don't have any clean underwear?"
msgstr "Tu es en train de me dire qu'avec toute cette merde, tu n'as pas un seul sous-vêtement propre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nice. I do that. It's easier."
msgstr "Cool. Je fais ça aussi. C'est plus simple."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did not expect to be discussing underwear habits with my trash can."
msgstr "Je ne m'attendais pas à parler d'habitudes de sous-vêtements avec ma poubelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Just when I thought you couldn't get any cuter."
msgstr "Ouah. Et moi qui pensais que tu ne pouvais pas être plus mignon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, life is full of surprises."
msgstr "Bah, la vie est pleine de surprises."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I didn't expect to spend this long talking to you."
msgstr "Je m'attendais pas à passer autant de temps à te parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't, generally."
msgstr "Je le fais pas, en général."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't what?"
msgstr "Tu ne fais pas quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Talk."
msgstr "Parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Well. I'm flattered."
msgstr "Oh. Eh bien. Je suis {{flatté|flattée|flatté·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like talking to you, too."
msgstr "Moi aussi, j'aime bien te parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I didn't say I liked talking to you."
msgstr "J'ai pas dit que j'aimais bien te parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/11
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just that it's... new. And weird."
msgstr "Juste que c'est... nouveau. Et bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/19
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And not terrible."
msgstr "Et pas horrible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/15/g-0/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Careful, don't be TOO nice to me, I'll get the wrong idea."
msgstr "Attention, ne sois pas TROP gentil avec moi, je vais me faire des idées."

