msgid "Shortest flirtation ever."
msgstr "Le flirt le plus court de l'histoire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on... I'm very good at opening things."
msgstr "Allez... je suis très {{doué|douée|doué·e}} pour ouvrir les choses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/7 cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr "... ouais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not really my thing."
msgstr "C'est pas trop mon truc."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I get bored pretty fast and I've found that when you're flirting with someone, you have to pretend not to be bored by them."
msgstr "Je m'ennuie assez vite, et j'ai remarqué que quand tu dragues quelqu'un, faut faire semblant qu'il t'ennuie pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Kind of a turn-off when they can see that you're bored."
msgstr "Ça refroidit un peu quand l'autre voit que tu t'ennuies."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... yeah. I can see that."
msgstr "Euh... ouais. Je vois ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you are bad at this."
msgstr "Ouais, t'es nul à ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Told ya. Anyway..."
msgstr "Je te l'avais dit. Bref..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/39/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Did you have anything else for me? If not, I've got a lot to do around here."
msgstr "T'avais autre chose pour moi ? Sinon, j'ai plein de trucs à faire ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/39/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, gotcha. You go through trash, touch trash, organize trash. What a trash job."
msgstr "Ouais, je vois. Tu tries des ordures, tu touches des ordures, tu ranges des ordures. Quel boulot pourri."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/39/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I've got some friendship and maybe sexual chemistry for ya, if you're interested."
msgstr "Eh bien, j'ai de l'amitié et peut-être un peu d'alchimie sexuelle pour toi, si ça t'intéresse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh, I know. Who do you think holds onto all those empty pickle jars, huh?"
msgstr "Oh, je sais. Qui c'est qui garde tous ces bocaux de cornichons vides, à ton avis ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Who the hell eats that many pickles."
msgstr "Qui c'est qui mange autant de cornichons, bordel."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What can I say, I like salty cylindrical objects."
msgstr "Que veux-tu, j'aime les objets cylindriques salés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "People with an oral fixation."
msgstr "Les gens qui ont une fixation orale."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey. Don't diss the dill."
msgstr "Hé. Touche pas au cornichon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. So you must be a fan of a good kabob, then."
msgstr "Tiens. Alors tu dois être fan des bonnes brochettes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, yeah. Big fan of that long wooden stick."
msgstr "Oh, ouais. Grand fan de ce long bâton en bois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I enjoy how messy they are. Lots of barbeque juice..."
msgstr "J'aime quand ça dégouline. Plein de jus de barbecue..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh. I get it."
msgstr "Oh. Je vois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're flirting with me right now."
msgstr "Tu me dragues, là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Guess I was being a little too subtle."
msgstr "Ouais. J'imagine que j'étais un peu trop subtil{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm trying... you're not exactly making it easy."
msgstr "J'essaie... tu ne me facilites pas vraiment la tâche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Gonna stop ya right there."
msgstr "Je vais t'arrêter tout de suite."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not really into flirting. Takes a lot of energy. Generally non-productive."
msgstr "Je suis pas trop branché drague. Ça demande beaucoup d'énergie. En général, pas productif."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Plus we have to pretend that we share interests. Which... I doubt."
msgstr "En plus, faut faire semblant d'avoir des centres d'intérêt communs. Ce qui... j'en doute."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We might, though."
msgstr "Peut-être qu'on en a, pourtant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We don't know until we check, right?"
msgstr "On ne peut pas savoir sans vérifier, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Do you like trash, too?"
msgstr "T'aimes les ordures, toi aussi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, all this junk? Well, no, obviously."
msgstr "Oh, toutes ces cochonneries ? Eh bien, non, évidemment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/24/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you serious? YOU don't really like all this shit, do you?"
msgstr "Tu es sérieux ? TOI, tu n'aimes pas vraiment toute cette merde, si ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You might want to get that checked."
msgstr "Tu devrais faire vérifier ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think you're supposed to move out of that phase at like, age 2."
msgstr "Je crois qu'on est censé sortir de ce stade vers, genre, 2 ans."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm ok with it. It's part of me at this point."
msgstr "Bof, ça me va. Ça fait partie de moi, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about I deal with that, if you deal with your crap-collecting habit. We'll do it together."
msgstr "Et si je m'en occupais, pendant que toi tu t'occupes de ta manie de collectionner la merde ? On le ferait ensemble."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well ok then. Not my place to change you."
msgstr "Bon ben d'accord. C'est pas à moi de te changer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn right."
msgstr "Tu l'as dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. I don't meet a lot of people that agree with me on that."
msgstr "Tiens. Je croise pas beaucoup de gens qui sont d'accord avec moi là-dessus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That it isn't your place to change people?"
msgstr "Que ce n'est pas à toi de changer les gens ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Almost everyone has something to say about other peoples' habits and choices, do you notice that?"
msgstr "Presque tout le monde a un truc à dire sur les habitudes et les choix des autres, t'as remarqué ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Everyone is so in everybody else's business."
msgstr "Tout le monde se mêle des affaires de tout le monde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's ridiculous."
msgstr "C'est ridicule."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Like me. I just want to be left alone to do what I want to do the way I want to do it."
msgstr "Moi, par exemple. Je veux juste qu'on me laisse faire ce que je veux, comme je veux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/47
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't get what's so complicated about that."
msgstr "Je vois pas ce que ça a de si compliqué."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "By that do you mean, you just want to collect useless garbage unmolested?"
msgstr "Par là, tu veux dire que tu veux juste collectionner des ordures inutiles sans qu'on t'embête ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... but I think the being surrounded by junk thing is probably not great for you socially..."
msgstr "Ouais... mais je pense qu'être entouré de cochonneries, ce n'est probablement pas génial pour ta vie sociale..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I would never."
msgstr "Jamais je ferais ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Dill pickles are one way we know we live in a benevolent universe."
msgstr "Les cornichons sont une des preuves qu'on vit dans un univers bienveillant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Either that, or they're proof that mankind has mastered vinegar."
msgstr "Soit ça, soit ils prouvent que l'humanité a maîtrisé le vinaigre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But still. Maybe include some non-jarred foods in your diet. Like grapes."
msgstr "Mais quand même. Mets peut-être quelques aliments qui sont pas en bocal dans ton régime. Genre du raisin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Or even one grape. A grape. Just for kicks."
msgstr "Ou même un seul grain. Un grain de raisin. Juste pour rire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know that you're one to talk about cleaning up your life."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas sûr{{|e|·e}} que tu sois bien placé pour parler de remettre de l'ordre dans sa vie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Ah ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-2/47/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I mean look at this place. Shit fest."
msgstr "Ouais. Enfin, regarde cet endroit. Le festival de la merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What the hell is a left field pitch."
msgstr "C'est quoi, bordel, un lancer qui part dans le champ gauche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That doesn't even make sense."
msgstr "Ça veut même rien dire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure it does. It's a pitch that goes to left field."
msgstr "Bien sûr que si. C'est un lancer qui part vers le champ gauche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you, a baseball expert?"
msgstr "T'es quoi, un expert en baseball ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pitches go towards the batter, not towards the outfield."
msgstr "Les lancers, ça part vers le batteur, pas vers le champ extérieur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Fizz brain."
msgstr "Cerveau pétillant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't have to be a genius to figure that one out."
msgstr "Pas besoin d'être un génie pour piger ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Right. Good point. Also, what is a fizz brain?"
msgstr "Oh. C'est vrai. Bien vu. Au fait, c'est quoi, un cerveau pétillant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Got me on that one! You're pretty smart, y'know."
msgstr "Ha ! Là, tu m'as eu ! T'es plutôt malin, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't know. I just made it up."
msgstr "J'sais pas. Je viens de l'inventer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess, though, it would be all those La Cruxes you drink have finally clogged your brain to the point where if I were to open up your skull all I'd hear is pamplemousse-flavored bubbles pinging around."
msgstr "Mais j'imagine que ça voudrait dire que toutes ces La Crux que tu bois ont fini par t'encrasser le cerveau au point que si je t'ouvrais le crâne, j'entendrais que des bulles goût pamplemousse rebondir dans tous les sens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Bubble pinball. Fizz brain."
msgstr "Flipper à bulles. Cerveau pétillant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like it."
msgstr "J'aime bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Screw pamplemousse."
msgstr "Le pamplemousse, je l'emmerde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm fundamentally offended."
msgstr "Je suis profondément {{offensé|offensée|offensé·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Whatever. Congratulations on having a reaction."
msgstr "Peu importe. Félicitations, t'as eu une réaction."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look, I don't mean to cut this short..."
msgstr "Écoute, je veux pas écourter..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Strike that, I completely do."
msgstr "Non, je retire, je veux complètement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "The thing that was in your underwear drawer, that wasn't moving when you found it, slide it on over here and let's move on with our day."
msgstr "Le truc qui était dans ton tiroir à sous-vêtements, qui bougeait pas quand tu l'as trouvé, fais-le glisser par ici et passons à la suite de notre journée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good. What have you got planned?"
msgstr "Ça marche. Tu as prévu quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You actually want me to give you this? It's disgusting."
msgstr "Tu veux vraiment que je te donne ça ? C'est dégoûtant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Uh... hadn't thought it out... probably mostly trash-related activities..."
msgstr "Euh... j'y avais pas réfléchi... sûrement surtout des activités liées aux ordures..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool, cool. Can you be more specific?"
msgstr "Cool, cool. Tu peux être plus précis ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok... still kinda hoping for something that doesn't involve touching anything."
msgstr "OK... j'espère encore un peu un truc où il ne faut rien toucher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Why do you care what I'm doing for the rest of my day?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tu t'intéresses à ce que je fais du reste de ma journée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Can't really see how it involves you."
msgstr "Je vois pas trop en quoi ça te concerne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hurtful. Not sure if I want to spend time with you now."
msgstr "Blessant. Je ne suis plus sûr{{|e|·e}} d'avoir envie de passer du temps avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, it could, though. I thought we could hang out."
msgstr "Eh bien, ça pourrait. Je pensais qu'on pourrait traîner ensemble."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, we won't be doing any of this together."
msgstr "Non, on fera rien de tout ça ensemble."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You just kind of invited yourself into my day... I'm more of a solo artist. If I haven't already been clear about that."
msgstr "Tu t'es un peu {{incrusté|incrustée|incrusté·e}} dans ma journée... Je suis plutôt artiste solo. Si je l'avais pas déjà dit clairement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So it's just going to be you, alone, wading around in your own nonsense."
msgstr "Donc ce sera juste toi, tout seul, à patauger dans ton propre bazar."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yep, I do, for the thousandth time. Hand it over."
msgstr "Ouaip, je veux, pour la millième fois. File."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You hand the unmentionable, sticky trash to Cam, doing your best not to look at it as you do so."
msgstr "Vous tendez à Cam l'innommable déchet collant, en faisant de votre mieux pour ne pas le regarder."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just... can't believe you actively want junk like this."
msgstr "Je n'arrive juste pas... à croire que tu veuilles vraiment des cochonneries pareilles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And once again with the shock."
msgstr "Et revoilà l'étonnement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe that's what's wrong with me. People like you assuming that because I'm a trash can, automatically I'm an idiot."
msgstr "C'est peut-être ça, mon problème. Les gens comme toi qui partent du principe que, parce que je suis une poubelle, je suis forcément un idiot."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think you're an idiot. I was complimenting you."
msgstr "Je ne pense pas que tu sois un idiot. Je te faisais un compliment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Man you are touchy."
msgstr "Bon sang, qu'est-ce que t'es susceptible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's cool. Don't worry about it. I'm used to it."
msgstr "C'est cool. T'inquiète pas. J'ai l'habitude."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Listen, do you have anything else you want to give me today?"
msgstr "Écoute, t'as autre chose à me donner aujourd'hui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If not, I've got some stuff to do and you probably have a baseball game to watch or something."
msgstr "Sinon, j'ai des trucs à faire et toi, t'as sûrement un match de baseball à regarder ou je sais pas quoi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. You clearly want me to go."
msgstr "OK. Visiblement, tu veux que je parte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Overstayed my welcome, I guess."
msgstr "J'ai abusé de ton hospitalité, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No. Maybe. I don't know."
msgstr "Non. Peut-être. J'sais pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/24/g-0/5
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just want to be alone now. So, g'bye."
msgstr "Je veux juste être seul, maintenant. Alors, salut."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-0/15/0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/c-1/23/g-0/24/g-0/10/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool. Have fun playing with all this filth."
msgstr "Cool. Amuse-toi bien avec toute cette crasse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, good place to start."
msgstr "Ouais, bon point de départ."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Don't get your nose too close, though. Sometimes this stuff can be pungent."
msgstr "Mais approche pas trop le nez. Parfois, ces trucs peuvent être forts."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I once singed off some of my own lining getting too close to a particularly powerful drain cleaner."
msgstr "Une fois, je me suis brûlé un bout de doublure en m'approchant trop d'un déboucheur particulièrement puissant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hope your drain is clear now, by the way."
msgstr "J'espère que ta canalisation est débouchée, au fait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, um... yeah. It is. Thanks."
msgstr "Oh, euh... ouais. Elle l'est. Merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know, I haven't actually checked. Probably not, though."
msgstr "Tu sais, je n'ai pas vérifié, en fait. Mais sûrement pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No sweat."
msgstr "T'inquiète."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How's your lining?"
msgstr "Comment va ta doublure ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hope you recovered from that diagnostic sniff."
msgstr "J'espère que tu t'es remis de ce reniflement de diagnostic."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Still singed."
msgstr "Toujours brûlée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'll live."
msgstr "J'y survivrai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Scars are badass."
msgstr "Les cicatrices, c'est la classe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-0/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't argue. Way more badass than living in all this useless garbage, if I'm honest."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas dire le contraire. Bien plus la classe que de vivre dans toutes ces ordures inutiles, si je suis honnête."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So you're a \"do the job until I don't feel like it and then stop thinking about it\" kinda person."
msgstr "Donc t'es du genre « je fais le boulot jusqu'à ce que j'aie plus envie, et après j'y pense plus »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah. Definitely."
msgstr "Oh, ouais. Carrément."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only when it comes to yucky things I didn't want to do in the first place."
msgstr "Seulement quand il s'agit de trucs dégueu que je n'avais pas envie de faire au départ."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Know thyself, I guess."
msgstr "Connais-toi toi-même, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, like you. I know I couldn't do what you do. Touching way too much filth involved."
msgstr "Eh bien, comme toi. Je sais que je ne pourrais pas faire ce que tu fais. Il faut toucher beaucoup trop de crasse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly. Like you know yourself. I don't enjoy touching crap like this, and you do. So, there ya go."
msgstr "Exactement. Comme toi, tu te connais. Je n'aime pas toucher des saletés pareilles, et toi, si. Et voilà."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What other yucky things have you had to do."
msgstr "Quels autres trucs dégueu t'as dû faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-1/42/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I could never do your job, for example. Touching all this shit, smelling it? No way."
msgstr "Eh bien, je ne pourrais jamais faire ton boulot, par exemple. Toucher toute cette merde, la sentir ? Hors de question."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, then give it here."
msgstr "Bon, ben file."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I didn't really care about the details, I'm gonna take it anyway."
msgstr "Je m'intéressais pas vraiment aux détails, je vais le prendre de toute façon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? Just sight unseen, you'll accept this mystery substance?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Sans même la voir, tu acceptes cette substance mystère ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are way braver than I am."
msgstr "Tu es bien plus courageux que moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's my job."
msgstr "C'est mon boulot."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And I like my job."
msgstr "Et j'aime mon boulot."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "One of the lucky few in this industrialized wasteland, I guess."
msgstr "Un des rares chanceux dans ce désert industrialisé, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blech. You'd have to pay me a lot to handle this nonsense, even if I knew what it was."
msgstr "Beurk. Il faudrait me payer cher pour manipuler ces saletés, même si je savais ce que c'était."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still. You're a brave little trash can."
msgstr "Quand même. Tu es une brave petite poubelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, goll-ee, friend-o. I've never been so admired."
msgstr "Ben dis donc, mon pote. On m'a jamais autant admiré."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/stuff_menu_for_cam/0/c-1/15/c-3/19/c-2/23/g-0/24/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seriously. To just take this shit and trust you'll be able to handle it? Courage."
msgstr "Sérieusement. Prendre cette merde en ayant confiance que tu sauras la gérer ? Ça, c'est du courage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Pretty openly flirting with you, and it would be nice if you participated."
msgstr "Ouais. Je te drague assez ouvertement, et ce serait sympa que tu participes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't notice?"
msgstr "Tu n'avais pas remarqué ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you, doofus. Play along? You might enjoy it."
msgstr "Je t'aime bien, banane. Tu joues le jeu ? Ça pourrait te plaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I. Don't. Flirt."
msgstr "Je. Drague. Pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Much. Or like, hardly ever."
msgstr "Beaucoup. Ou genre, presque jamais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ah man, now I'm uncomfortable."
msgstr "Ah, mec, maintenant je suis mal à l'aise."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why? This is pretty normal."
msgstr "Pourquoi ? C'est plutôt normal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's ok. I get that way too, sometimes."
msgstr "C'est pas grave. Ça m'arrive aussi, parfois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Telling me that my reaction is weird is really not helpful."
msgstr "Me dire que ma réaction est bizarre, ça m'aide vraiment pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "God, are you trying to make me miserable?"
msgstr "Bon sang, t'essaies de me rendre malheureux ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're funny when you're flustered."
msgstr "Tu es drôle quand tu es gêné."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I just... relax. This is supposed to be fun."
msgstr "Non, c'est juste que... détends-toi. C'est censé être amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "Ouah."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'll bet YOU'RE funny flat on your ass after slipping on one of your take-out containers."
msgstr "Je parie que TOI, t'es drôle, le cul par terre après avoir glissé sur une de tes barquettes de plats à emporter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe I'll get to see that one day."
msgstr "Peut-être que j'aurai la chance de voir ça un jour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "In the meantime, you're excused."
msgstr "En attendant, t'es {{excusé|excusée|excusé·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh come on, I was just kidding."
msgstr "Oh, allez, je plaisantais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know what? Fine. You're clearly not into this. Have fun sorting through all your own filth."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi ? Très bien. Visiblement, ça ne te branche pas. Amuse-toi bien à trier ta propre crasse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr "Je m'en fiche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I might not be a great flirt, but I know that insulting people is a pretty bad way to start."
msgstr "Je suis peut-être pas doué pour draguer, mais je sais qu'insulter les gens, c'est une assez mauvaise façon de commencer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe you can come back and try again when YOU'VE learned more about how to do this."
msgstr "Tu pourras peut-être revenir réessayer quand TOI, t'en sauras un peu plus sur la façon de faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok... I'll go. Can't believe you'd rather wade through crap than joke around with me."
msgstr "OK... je m'en vais. Je n'arrive pas à croire que tu préfères patauger dans la merde plutôt que de rigoler avec moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't mean to hurt your feelings. You're kind of sensitive for someone surrounded by hot garbage all the time."
msgstr "Je ne voulais pas te vexer. Tu es plutôt sensible, pour quelqu'un qui vit au milieu d'ordures fumantes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, well, I've heard that \"board game nights\" are supposed to be fun, too, and if you want my opinion, those people are nuts."
msgstr "Ouais, ben, on m'a dit que les « soirées jeux de société », c'est censé être amusant aussi, et si tu veux mon avis, ces gens sont barges."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like board game night."
msgstr "J'aime bien les soirées jeux de société."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hear ya! I'm more of a card player myself."
msgstr "Je te comprends ! Moi, je suis plutôt jeux de cartes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Of course you do."
msgstr "Évidemment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You'd have to tie me to the chair."
msgstr "Faudrait m'attacher à la chaise."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm. I might like tying you to a chair."
msgstr "Hm. Ça me plairait peut-être bien, de t'attacher à une chaise."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nobody's going to force you to play Uno, Cam."
msgstr "Personne ne va te forcer à jouer au Uno, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Je..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Now that you mention it..."
msgstr "Maintenant que tu le dis..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ha. Who are we kidding. You wouldn't come close enough to me to tie me to anything."
msgstr "Ha. Qui on essaie de tromper. Tu t'approcherais jamais assez de moi pour m'attacher à quoi que ce soit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, you might be right. That's a lot of shit to get through."
msgstr "Bah, t'as peut-être raison. Ça fait beaucoup de merde à traverser."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Damn right. I'll just be over here, doing my thing, and you can be over there doing yours."
msgstr "Un peu, ouais. Je vais juste rester ici à faire mon truc, et toi, tu peux rester là-bas à faire le tien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And every once in a while, I'll toss some smelly garbage your way and we'll pretend we relate well."
msgstr "Et de temps en temps, je te balancerai des ordures qui puent et on fera semblant de bien s'entendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I had a deck of cards once."
msgstr "J'ai eu un jeu de cartes, une fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It was missing the ten of clubs, the jack of hearts, and the whole thing had soaked in a puddle of beer and, best guess, salt and vinegar potato chip dust."
msgstr "Il manquait le dix de trèfle, le valet de coeur, et le tout avait trempé dans une flaque de bière et, d'après moi, de poussière de chips sel et vinaigre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Had some great nights with those cards."
msgstr "J'ai passé de super soirées avec ces cartes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yuck."
msgstr "Beurk."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why does that sound delicious to me."
msgstr "Pourquoi ça me paraît délicieux ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yuck. You say yuck a lot."
msgstr "Beurk. Tu dis souvent beurk."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess everything I do and everything I like is gonna be yuck to you, huh."
msgstr "J'imagine que tout ce que je fais et tout ce que j'aime, ça va être beurk pour toi, hein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cam, I'm not totally out of line with that. You keep, and like, a lot of weird shit."
msgstr "Cam, je n'exagère pas tant que ça. Tu gardes, et tu aimes, plein de trucs chelous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Because your tastes are finally expanding."
msgstr "Parce que tes goûts s'élargissent enfin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Welcome to the rest of your life."
msgstr "Bienvenue dans le reste de ta vie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's not jump the gun here. I'm way not ready to embrace most of this hot mess."
msgstr "Ne nous emballons pas. Je ne suis pas du tout {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}} à adopter la plupart de ce gros bazar."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you don't like this either, then what are we doing."
msgstr "Si t'aimes pas ça non plus, alors qu'est-ce qu'on fait là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trying something new together, I guess."
msgstr "On essaie un truc nouveau ensemble, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We are hanging out. That's all."
msgstr "On traîne ensemble. C'est tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't like \"together.\" I like \"separate,\" \"alone,\" \"by myself.\""
msgstr "J'aime pas « ensemble ». J'aime « séparément », « seul », « tout seul »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Man, you're really making this hard."
msgstr "Bon sang, tu ne me facilites vraiment pas la tâche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we be alone, but maybe just share space?"
msgstr "On peut être seuls, mais peut-être juste partager l'espace ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. I'm not doing anything."
msgstr "Pff. Je fais rien du tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're trying to make me do something I don't want to do and I'm responding honestly with..."
msgstr "T'essaies de me faire faire un truc que je veux pas faire, et moi je te réponds honnêtement..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No."
msgstr "Non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Can't you just, like, toss me some trash and leave me alone?"
msgstr "Tu peux pas juste, genre, me balancer des ordures et me foutre la paix ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure. I guess actual shit is better for you than shitty conversation."
msgstr "Bien sûr. J'imagine que de la vraie merde te convient mieux qu'une conversation merdique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No problem. Kinda had enough of your stupid garbage myself."
msgstr "Pas de problème. J'en ai un peu marre de tes ordures débiles, moi aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What the hell does that even mean. How can you share space."
msgstr "Ça veut dire quoi, ça, bordel. Comment on peut partager l'espace."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I take up this space, you take up that space."
msgstr "Moi, j'occupe cet espace-là, toi, t'occupes cet espace-là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You in mine and me in yours isn't sharing, it's invasion."
msgstr "Toi dans le mien et moi dans le tien, c'est pas du partage, c'est une invasion."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're talking about trying to \"host\" an invading force."
msgstr "Tu parles d'essayer d'« accueillir » une force d'invasion."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Gum Tzu would not dig it."
msgstr "Gum Tzu kifferait pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good lord, Sun Tzu?"
msgstr "Seigneur, Sun Tzu ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... that's... true in a way, I guess."
msgstr "Ouais... c'est... vrai, d'une certaine façon, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/47/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. The Art of Drawer has some great life lessons."
msgstr "Ouais. L'Art du tiroir est plein de grandes leçons de vie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/47/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you're taking life lessons from a manual on war, your shit-collecting as a lifestyle starts to make sense."
msgstr "Si tu prends des leçons de vie dans un manuel de guerre, ton mode de vie de collectionneur de merde commence à prendre son sens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "\"Hanging out.\" What are we, dangling out of a tree or something? What a weird phrase."
msgstr "« Traîner ensemble. » Traîner quoi, nos phalanges par terre ? Drôle d'expression."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Super weird. Wonder where it came from."
msgstr "Super bizarre. Je me demande d'où ça vient."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, humans are primates. That had to rear its head eventually."
msgstr "Bah, les humains sont des primates. Ça devait finir par ressortir un jour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Never thought of it that way."
msgstr "Ha ! Je n'avais jamais vu les choses comme ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool perspective."
msgstr "Point de vue intéressant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I blow your mind a lot."
msgstr "Je te retourne souvent le cerveau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-0/31/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, kinda. It's weird to get deep insight from a trash can dressed in filth."
msgstr "Eh bien, un peu. C'est bizarre de recevoir des réflexions profondes d'une poubelle habillée de crasse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, I noticed."
msgstr "Non, j'avais remarqué."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was just hoping you'd stop."
msgstr "J'espérais juste que t'arrêterais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I never know what to do with... well, it's just weird when people like me."
msgstr "Je sais jamais quoi faire quand... bah, c'est juste bizarre quand les gens m'aiment bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry, you don't have to do anything. Just talk to me."
msgstr "Ne t'inquiète pas, tu n'as rien à faire. Parle-moi, c'est tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A lot of people are morons. You're super likeable."
msgstr "Plein de gens sont des abrutis. Toi, tu es super attachant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Aaaand I'm already tired."
msgstr "Eeeet je suis déjà fatigué."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look, I... I gotta go. I've got stuff to do."
msgstr "Écoute, je... faut que j'y aille. J'ai des trucs à faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get it. Got some crap to organize."
msgstr "Je comprends. Tu as de la merde à ranger."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's ok. Maybe I can come back later?"
msgstr "C'est pas grave. Je peux peut-être revenir plus tard ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/23/c-1/15 cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "Peut-être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-0/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll try to bring some more interesting shit with me."
msgstr "J'essaierai d'apporter de la merde plus intéressante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well. I agree about the first part."
msgstr "Bon. Je suis d'accord pour la première partie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess me being likeable is a matter of taste."
msgstr "J'imagine que le fait que je sois attachant, c'est une question de goût."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I have good taste?"
msgstr "Donc j'ai bon goût ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You think you're cool, too, don't you?"
msgstr "Toi aussi, tu te trouves cool, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I am what I am. You liking me or not liking me isn't so much about either one of us being right. Just... you like me."
msgstr "Je suis ce que je suis. Que tu m'aimes ou pas, c'est pas vraiment une question de qui a raison. Juste... tu m'aimes bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's still weird."
msgstr "Ça reste bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-1/31/c-1/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Weirder than having a large and rotating collection of waste?"
msgstr "Plus bizarre que d'avoir une grande collection tournante de déchets ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, you calling me doofus helps."
msgstr "Ouais, que tu me traites de banane, ça aide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, you're being a doofus."
msgstr "Eh bien, tu fais la banane."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry. But I try to be honest."
msgstr "Désolé{{|e|·e}}. Mais j'essaie d'être honnête."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I get that."
msgstr "Je comprends."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. I've never been insulted... and liked it."
msgstr "Tiens. On m'a jamais insulté... en me faisant plaisir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not sure what to do now."
msgstr "Je sais pas trop quoi faire, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/chemistry/0/c-2/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Make a space in some of this shit and we'll insult each other some more."
msgstr "Fais-moi une place dans une partie de cette merde, et on s'insultera encore un peu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. That was really cool."
msgstr "Tiens. C'était vraiment cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was cool?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui était cool ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know! Wait, what are you talking about?"
msgstr "Je sais ! Attends, de quoi tu parles ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That was a fun conversation."
msgstr "C'était une conversation sympa."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Whoa. Weird."
msgstr "Ouah. Bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...uh."
msgstr "... euh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Anyway... so yeah, you can come back and hang or whatever."
msgstr "Bref... donc ouais, tu peux revenir traîner ou peu importe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Gonna go now before I get awkward or whatever."
msgstr "Je vais y aller avant de devenir gêné ou peu importe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I said whatever twice."
msgstr "J'ai dit « peu importe » deux fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/51 cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr "Peu importe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Damn. Shit."
msgstr "Merde. Fait chier."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/78
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not awkward right now, at all. For sure."
msgstr "Je suis pas gêné du tout, là. Sûr et certain."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... yeah, you're good."
msgstr "Ouais... ouais, ça va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-0/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh Cam. It's hard to see ourselves sometimes, isn't it."
msgstr "Oh, Cam. C'est dur de se voir tel qu'on est, parfois, hein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're cool."
msgstr "T'es cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Get out."
msgstr "Dégage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, shit."
msgstr "Bon, merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...what..."
msgstr "... quoi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh god, you just made me so nervous."
msgstr "Oh mon dieu, tu viens de me rendre super {{nerveux|nerveuse|nerveux·se}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, it's all good, it's just..."
msgstr "Non, tout va bien, c'est juste..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This has never happened to me before."
msgstr "Ça m'est jamais arrivé avant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You... we just had fun last time. You said cool things, and you didn't piss me off or insult me or denigrate me..."
msgstr "Toi... on s'est juste bien amusés la dernière fois. T'as dit des trucs cool, et tu m'as pas énervé, ni insulté, ni rabaissé..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I just... like you."
msgstr "Je... t'aime bien, c'est tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Legit have no idea what to do with that."
msgstr "Franchement, j'ai aucune idée de quoi faire de ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Other than to say you're awesome."
msgstr "À part te dire que t'es génial{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And believe you me, that comment is a rare-ass commodity. If it were possible, I'd say frame it. Or bronze it. Or whatever people do when they're like, proud of something."
msgstr "Et crois-moi, ce genre de commentaire, c'est une putain de denrée rare. Si c'était possible, je te dirais de l'encadrer. Ou de le couler dans le bronze. Ou je sais pas ce que les gens font quand ils sont, genre, fiers de quelque chose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn Cam, thank you."
msgstr "Bon sang, Cam, merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah, man, you're awesome, too!"
msgstr "Ah, mec, toi aussi, t'es génial !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. Anyway, I dunno how you're feeling, but I'm thinking we've got a pretty cool future ahead of us."
msgstr "Ouais. Bref, je sais pas ce que t'en penses, mais je me dis qu'on a un avenir plutôt cool devant nous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And again. I NEVER feel that way. So. Take notes."
msgstr "Et encore une fois. Je ressens JAMAIS ça. Alors. Prends des notes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's be friends, then."
msgstr "Soyons amis, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm looking for love."
msgstr "Je cherche l'amour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Let's."
msgstr "Soyons-le."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_diamond_return/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Thought you'd never ask."
msgstr "Je croyais que tu demanderais jamais."

