#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/12
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hey, look... I'm not a huge fan of that kinda talk."
msgstr "Hé, écoute... je suis pas très fan de ce genre de vocabulaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gotta be kidding me. You act like you're so high and mighty."
msgstr "Tu te fiches de moi. Tu te prends pour qui, à faire le grand seigneur ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's... I dunno, demeaning or whatever."
msgstr "C'est... j'sais pas, dégradant, ou peu importe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No biggie, just find another way of speaking. It's not like there's a shortage of words in the world."
msgstr "Pas de souci, trouve juste une autre façon de parler. C'est pas comme si on manquait de mots sur cette terre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa. Didn't realize you were so sensitive."
msgstr "Ouah. Je ne savais pas que tu étais si sensible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man, I'm sorry, I didn't mean it."
msgstr "Oh, mince, je suis {{désolé|désolée|désolé·e}}, je ne voulais pas dire ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah well. It's cool. Just a note for the future."
msgstr "Ouais, bon. C'est cool. Juste une remarque pour la suite."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have opinions, all right?"
msgstr "J'ai des opinions, d'accord ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm garbage. I'm trash."
msgstr "Je suis une poubelle. Je suis un déchet."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But I'm not worthless."
msgstr "Mais je suis pas sans valeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sue me."
msgstr "Fais-moi un procès."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_join/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "Salut."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I've already told you this once, why am I having to say it again."
msgstr "Je te l'ai déjà dit une fois, pourquoi je dois le répéter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't like that kinda talk. I'm a fairly easygoing can. Don't think I'm asking for a lot."
msgstr "J'aime pas ce genre de vocabulaire. Je suis une poubelle plutôt cool. Je crois pas demander grand-chose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't get it."
msgstr "Je ne comprends pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh come on, it's just a word!"
msgstr "Oh, allez, ce n'est qu'un mot !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm seriously warning you now."
msgstr "Là, je te préviens sérieusement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Choose your words carefully."
msgstr "Choisis bien tes mots."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok ok, I got it. Sorry."
msgstr "OK, OK, j'ai compris. Pardon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... I forgot. Won't happen again."
msgstr "Ouais... j'avais oublié. Ça ne se reproduira pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - my word is 'you suck'."
msgstr "OK, mes mots, c'est « t'es nul »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/7 cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-1/7 cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "These were the wrong words to choose. Cam turns his back and leaves."
msgstr "C'étaient les mauvais mots à choisir. Cam vous tourne le dos et s'en va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-0/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's two words, asshat."
msgstr "Ça fait deux mots, tête de noeud."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, and words don't have power, right?"
msgstr "Ouais, et les mots ont aucun pouvoir, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Battle cries, and manifestos, and national anthems? That's all just a lot of hot air, right?"
msgstr "Les cris de guerre, les manifestes, les hymnes nationaux ? Tout ça, c'est juste du vent, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It means something to me, is all I'm saying."
msgstr "Ça compte pour moi, c'est tout ce que je dis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, Cam. Good point. I'll watch it."
msgstr "OK, Cam. Bien vu. Je ferai attention."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotcha. I'll try, I promise."
msgstr "Compris. J'essaierai, promis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh for can's sake."
msgstr "Oh, pour l'amour de la poubelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_2/0/c-1/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Out."
msgstr "Dehors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/12
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You kidding me?"
msgstr "Tu te fous de moi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, come on, you're not offended again, are you?"
msgstr "Oh, allez, tu n'es pas encore vexé, si ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no, I didn't... hang on..."
msgstr "Oh non, je ne voulais pas... attends..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I swear there were no good options!"
msgstr "Je te jure qu'il n'y avait aucune bonne option !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I gotta tell ya. I have had it right up to my lid with this shit."
msgstr "Faut que je te dise. J'en ai jusqu'au couvercle de ces conneries."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This subtle judgment. This super-cool dismissal and mockery..."
msgstr "Ce jugement subtil. Ce mépris et ces moqueries super cool..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And then the \"niceness,\" almost like by insulting me you're doing me a favor."
msgstr "Et ensuite, la « gentillesse », comme si en m'insultant tu me rendais service."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You think I don't know what I am? You think I need to be reminded, like I've forgotten what I do?"
msgstr "Tu crois que je sais pas ce que je suis ? Tu crois qu'il faut me le rappeler, comme si j'avais oublié ce que je fais ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And more importantly, you think that by reminding me or shaming me, you're gonna change me??"
msgstr "Et surtout, tu crois qu'en me le rappelant ou en me faisant honte, tu vas me changer ??"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Never gonna happen."
msgstr "Ça arrivera jamais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Give it up, walk away, check your own bullshit that you think you have any right to tell me what to do, how to do it, or especially what to like."
msgstr "Laisse tomber, va-t'en, et remets en question ta connerie de croire que t'as le moindre droit de me dire quoi faire, comment le faire, ou surtout quoi aimer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't even care whether or not you mean to do it, but stop. Figure it out and stop."
msgstr "Je m'en fiche même de savoir si tu le fais exprès ou pas, mais arrête. Pige-le et arrête."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And if you can't stop, if you just have to fix things around you to make yourself more comfortable..."
msgstr "Et si t'arrives pas à arrêter, si t'as absolument besoin de réparer ce qui t'entoure pour être plus à l'aise..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/72
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Got a solution for ya."
msgstr "J'ai une solution pour toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/80
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Don't be around me."
msgstr "Reste pas près de moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/88
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I like me. I really like me. I have no intention of changing or adjusting for you or anyone and if you don't like it, it's no plastic off my ass."
msgstr "Je m'aime bien. Je m'aime vraiment bien. J'ai aucune intention de changer ou de m'adapter pour toi ou pour qui que ce soit, et si ça te plaît pas, ça me fait ni chaud ni froid au fond du sac."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/96
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You can bring your trash to me or not, talk to me or not, but degrade or denigrate me one more time and I'll turn your kitchen into a toxic waste pit."
msgstr "Tu peux m'apporter tes ordures ou pas, me parler ou pas, mais rabaisse-moi ou dénigre-moi encore une fois et je transforme ta cuisine en décharge de déchets toxiques."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/104
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And I'll enjoy it, too."
msgstr "Et j'y prendrai plaisir, en plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crap_3/0/g-0/112
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Have a peach of a day."
msgstr "Passe une journée pêchue."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You came back."
msgstr "T'es revenu{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pigs do fly, I guess."
msgstr "Les cochons volent, faut croire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How could I stay away? Hoping for another vitriolic outburst."
msgstr "Comment j'aurais pu rester loin ? J'espère une autre explosion de vitriol."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're irritating... but I think you may have been right."
msgstr "Tu es agaçant... mais je crois que tu avais peut-être raison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to apolog... wait did you just call me a pig?"
msgstr "Je voulais m'excus... attends, tu viens de me traiter de cochon ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Careful what you wish for."
msgstr "Fais gaffe à ce que tu souhaites."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still sensitive, I see."
msgstr "Toujours aussi sensible, à ce que je vois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wasn't trying to piss you off, y'know."
msgstr "Je n'essayais pas de te foutre en rogne, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Are we really going to do this dance again?"
msgstr "On va vraiment refaire cette danse ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not rising to the same bait twice."
msgstr "Je mords pas deux fois au même hameçon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So if you're looking for a toy to play with, I'm sure the neighbor's cat has something you might like."
msgstr "Alors si tu cherches un jouet, je suis sûr que le chat du voisin a un truc qui te plaira."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure you don't? Gotta be something diverting in this junk heap."
msgstr "T'es sûr que t'as rien ? Il doit bien y avoir un truc distrayant dans ce tas de cochonneries."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm allergic, but thanks."
msgstr "Non, je suis allergique, mais merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not trying to bait you. Just... you have to admit you're a little touchy."
msgstr "Je ne cherche pas à te provoquer. C'est juste que... avoue que tu es un peu susceptible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. Definitely wasn't being serious."
msgstr "Pff. C'était clairement pas sérieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look, was there anything you wanted to say to me?"
msgstr "Écoute, t'avais un truc à me dire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Get to it. Cuz if not, I'm talked out with you."
msgstr "Accouche. Parce que sinon, j'ai plus rien à te dire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I wanted to say your rant was totally uncalled for."
msgstr "Ouais. Je voulais te dire que ta tirade était complètement déplacée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You hurt my feelings, Cam."
msgstr "Tu m'as blessé{{|e|·e}}, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ah. Feelings."
msgstr "Ah. Les sentiments."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, you kinda hurt mine too, since we're sharing."
msgstr "Ben, toi aussi tu m'as un peu blessé, puisqu'on se confie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I was just expressing myself, but I clearly upset you. I'm apologizing. Can you?"
msgstr "Je suis {{désolé|désolée|désolé·e}}. Je m'exprimais, c'est tout, mais visiblement je t'ai contrarié. Je m'excuse. Tu peux en faire autant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, please. It was just teasing."
msgstr "Oh, je t'en prie. C'était juste pour te taquiner."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sure I can. And I will when I think I've done something wrong."
msgstr "Bien sûr que je peux. Et je le ferai quand je penserai avoir fait quelque chose de mal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I defended myself. That's still allowed."
msgstr "Je me suis défendu. C'est encore permis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You totally flew off the handle!"
msgstr "Tu t'es complètement emporté !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm telling you that you hurt me. Isn't that enough to warrant an apology?"
msgstr "Je te dis que tu m'as fait du mal. Ça ne mérite pas des excuses ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's what you call it??"
msgstr "C'est comme ça que t'appelles ça ??"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So you expressing yourself is healthy, and when I do it, I'm flying off the handle??"
msgstr "Donc quand toi tu t'exprimes, c'est sain, et quand moi je le fais, je m'emporte ??"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm done. I don't even have the will, much less the energy to explain this again."
msgstr "J'en ai marre. J'ai même pas la volonté, encore moins l'énergie, de réexpliquer ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Thanks for the trash. The deposits are gold."
msgstr "Merci pour les ordures. Les dépôts valent de l'or."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But I think that's where this experiment in talking to each other is gonna end."
msgstr "Mais je crois que c'est là que s'arrête cette expérience où on se parle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I mean, I guess..."
msgstr "Enfin, j'imagine..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh damn."
msgstr "Oh, merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're not gonna say \"psych\" or \"gotcha\" or something stupid if I say I'm sorry, are you?"
msgstr "Tu vas pas dire « je t'ai eu » ou « c'était pour rire » ou un truc débile si je dis que je suis désolé, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who would do that."
msgstr "Qui ferait ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That wasn't my plan, no."
msgstr "Ce n'était pas mon plan, non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You'd be surprised."
msgstr "Tu serais surpris{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ok, then."
msgstr "OK, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm sorry that I hurt your feelings."
msgstr "Je suis désolé de t'avoir blessé{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe both of us are... sensitive."
msgstr "Peut-être qu'on est tous les deux... sensibles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It shouldn't be this easy for someone to upset you, right?"
msgstr "Ça devrait pas être aussi facile de se faire contrarier, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Shouldn't we... shouldn't I be tougher?"
msgstr "On devrait pas... je devrais pas être plus dur ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can work on not letting people get to us."
msgstr "On peut travailler à ne pas laisser les gens nous atteindre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/47/g-0/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. I actually really like you just the way you are."
msgstr "Non. En fait, je t'aime vraiment comme tu es."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Look. I don't usually even go in for the whole feelings parade thing."
msgstr "Écoute. D'habitude, je suis même pas client de toute la parade des sentiments."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And if the best you can do is make fun of me, and then make fun of me reacting to getting made fun of..."
msgstr "Et si le mieux que tu puisses faire, c'est te moquer de moi, puis te moquer de ma réaction quand on se moque de moi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have better things to do."
msgstr "J'ai mieux à faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like what, separate glass and plastic?"
msgstr "Comme quoi, séparer le verre et le plastique ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're just so much more sensitive than I thought a trash can would be."
msgstr "Tu es juste bien plus sensible que je ne l'imaginais pour une poubelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. I'm bored of this."
msgstr "Ouais. Ça me saoule."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "One, never said I wasn't."
msgstr "Un, j'ai jamais dit que je l'étais pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Two, there's nothing wrong with that."
msgstr "Deux, y a rien de mal à ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Three, if it bothers you so much, why the hell did you come back?"
msgstr "Trois, si ça te dérange tellement, pourquoi t'es revenu{{|e|·e}}, bordel ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Y'know what? Don't answer that. I'm done."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi ? Réponds pas. J'en ai fini."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I can only imagine how effective you would've been if you'd meant to do it."
msgstr "J'ose à peine imaginer l'efficacité que t'aurais eue si tu l'avais fait exprès."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I am way better at things when I actually care about them."
msgstr "Ouais. Je suis bien meilleur{{|e|·e}} quand les choses me tiennent vraiment à coeur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We just have different styles. Different things we like."
msgstr "On a juste des styles différents. Des goûts différents."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Kinda curious now."
msgstr "Ça me rend un peu curieux, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wanna try and upset me and see how well you do?"
msgstr "Tu veux essayer de me contrarier pour voir si t'y arrives ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, not really. Didn't have a lot of fun the last time you were peeved."
msgstr "Euh, pas vraiment. Je ne me suis pas beaucoup amusé{{|e|·e}} la dernière fois que tu étais en rogne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, why not. Could be fun, right?"
msgstr "Oh, et puis pourquoi pas. Ça pourrait être drôle, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Smart move."
msgstr "Bien joué."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I wasn't kidding about the toxic waste site thing."
msgstr "Je plaisantais pas, pour le coup de la décharge toxique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "One time, I actually did it by accident... my bag broke while this joker was on vacation and stuff leaked out onto the floor for like ten days."
msgstr "Une fois, je l'ai fait par accident, en vrai... mon sac a craqué pendant que l'autre zouave était en vacances, et ça a coulé par terre pendant genre dix jours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It was gross. I was so proud."
msgstr "C'était dégueu. J'étais trop fier."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...that was me. That was last year, Cam."
msgstr "... c'était moi. C'était l'année dernière, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Weird thing to be proud of, man."
msgstr "Bizarre, comme truc dont être fier, mec."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...oh."
msgstr "... oh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Guess that'll teach ya to leave a full bag of trash in the house when you head out to the beach, huh?"
msgstr "Ça t'apprendra à laisser un sac d'ordures plein dans la maison quand tu pars à la plage, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, lesson learned."
msgstr "Ouais, leçon retenue."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I won't do it again now I know you."
msgstr "Je ne le referai plus, maintenant que je te connais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Awesome. Glad to hear it."
msgstr "Génial. Content de l'entendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So. Anything else on your mind, or...?"
msgstr "Alors. T'as autre chose en tête, ou... ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, actually... wanted to tell you you're kinda hot when you're mad..."
msgstr "Eh bien, en fait... je voulais te dire que tu es plutôt sexy quand tu es en colère..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really. Just wanted to make sure we were cool."
msgstr "Pas vraiment. Je voulais juste m'assurer que tout allait bien entre nous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "As far as I'm concerned, yeah."
msgstr "En ce qui me concerne, ouais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We don't have to agree on everything."
msgstr "On est pas obligés d'être d'accord sur tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-0/26/g-0/16/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "As long as we aren't dicks to each other, the truck keeps on runnin'."
msgstr "Tant qu'on est pas des connards l'un envers l'autre, le camion poubelle continue de rouler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You didn't seriously just say that."
msgstr "T'as pas sérieusement dit ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Weird? My pride is weird? Why, because it's trash?"
msgstr "Bizarre ? Ma fierté est bizarre ? Pourquoi, parce que c'est des ordures ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not doing this again. Thanks for the regular deliveries; keep 'em up."
msgstr "Je refais pas ça. Merci pour les livraisons régulières, continue comme ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/39/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But no more talking. I'm not going to hold your hand as you learn how not to say boneheaded things to me."
msgstr "Mais on se parle plus. Je vais pas te tenir la main pendant que t'apprends à pas me sortir des trucs débiles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr "T'es sérieux{{|se|·se}} ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Do you actually want to try and piss me off or do you seriously think it could be fun?"
msgstr "Tu veux vraiment essayer de me foutre en rogne, ou tu penses sérieusement que ça pourrait être drôle ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it could be fun. I like sparring with you."
msgstr "Je pense que ça pourrait être drôle. J'aime bien croiser le fer avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...neither. I was actually just trying to end the conversation nicely."
msgstr "... ni l'un ni l'autre. En fait, j'essayais juste de finir la conversation gentiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sparring."
msgstr "Croiser le fer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What are we, knights? MMA fighters?"
msgstr "On est quoi, des chevaliers ? Des combattants de MMA ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Verbal MMA fighters. It's kinda sexy."
msgstr "Ouais. Des combattants de MMA verbal. C'est plutôt sexy."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's just fun to talk to someone who's quick. Smart."
msgstr "C'est juste sympa de parler avec quelqu'un qui a de la répartie. Intelligent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wait. So this whole time... you were having fun."
msgstr "Attends. Donc depuis le début... tu t'amusais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We were playing."
msgstr "On jouait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, not the whole time. You can be intense."
msgstr "Eh bien, pas depuis le début. Tu peux être intense."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For sure. Why do you think I kept talking?"
msgstr "Carrément. Pourquoi tu crois que je continuais à parler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. That's interesting."
msgstr "Tiens. C'est intéressant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-0/23/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess I'm so used to people judging me, I didn't think anyone could trade barbs and be... enjoying it."
msgstr "J'imagine que j'ai tellement l'habitude que les gens me jugent que je pensais pas qu'on puisse se lancer des piques en... y prenant plaisir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh, sure. That makes sense."
msgstr "Oh, bien sûr. Ça se tient."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Let me help you."
msgstr "Laisse-moi t'aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh yeah? And what do you like?"
msgstr "Ah ouais ? Et toi, t'aimes quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lots of stuff. Food, music. Sleeping."
msgstr "Plein de trucs. La bouffe, la musique. Dormir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you know you've never asked me that before?"
msgstr "Tu sais que tu ne m'avais jamais posé la question ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sounds... generic."
msgstr "Ça a l'air... banal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, I never said I was a trailblazer."
msgstr "Hé, je n'ai jamais dit que j'étais {{un pionnier|une pionnière|un·e pionnier·ère}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So is a grilled cheese, but show me a more perfect food."
msgstr "Un croque-monsieur aussi, c'est banal, mais montre-moi un aliment plus parfait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ha. Fair enough."
msgstr "Ha. C'est vrai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I haven't had a grilled cheese in a long time."
msgstr "Ça fait longtemps que j'ai pas mangé de croque-monsieur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I finish them every time I make them so... none left for you."
msgstr "Ouais. Je les finis à chaque fois que j'en fais, alors... il n'en reste pas pour toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We could rectify that."
msgstr "On pourrait arranger ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well then. Let's make some grilled cheese."
msgstr "Bon ben alors. Faisons des croque-monsieur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pretty sure I've got the bread butts in here somewhere..."
msgstr "Je suis sûr que j'ai des culs de pain quelque part là-dedans..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... cool."
msgstr "Oh... cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, it's ok, I'll use new bread. Before we do that, though, I am sorry for insulting you."
msgstr "Oh, c'est bon, je vais prendre du pain neuf. Mais avant ça, je suis {{désolé|désolée|désolé·e}} de t'avoir insulté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotta love a good butt. And a good apology also?"
msgstr "Rien ne vaut un bon cul. Et de bonnes excuses, aussi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Here you go, fresh butts."
msgstr "Tiens, des culs tout frais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah. Thanks."
msgstr "Ah ouais. Merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Was there something else you wanted to say now that you know you've been a dick and I made you food?"
msgstr "T'avais autre chose à dire, maintenant que tu sais que t'as été {{un connard|une connasse|odieux·se}} et que je t'ai fait à manger ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16/c-0/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know I should apologize, I'm just bad at it."
msgstr "Je sais que je devrais m'excuser, mais je suis {{nul|nulle|nul·le}} pour ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...really?"
msgstr "... vraiment ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup. Really."
msgstr "Ouaip. Vraiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Um... no. No, I didn't realize that."
msgstr "Euh... non. Non, je m'étais pas rendu compte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm... oh hell, I don't know, I'm sorry I guess."
msgstr "Je suis... oh et puis merde, j'sais pas, désolé, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm just used to people assuming I'm dirty. Or dumb."
msgstr "J'ai juste l'habitude que les gens me croient sale. Ou con."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "They jump down my throat before I even get the chance to give a shit about them."
msgstr "Ils me sautent à la gorge avant même que j'aie l'occasion de m'intéresser à eux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know. I think I might have done that. My bad."
msgstr "Je sais. Je crois que je l'ai fait aussi. Pardon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Easy mistake to make."
msgstr "Une erreur facile à faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe if you were a little more interested in others, they'd be more interested in you."
msgstr "Peut-être que si tu t'intéressais un peu plus aux autres, ils s'intéresseraient plus à toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And why is it my responsibility to go first?"
msgstr "Et pourquoi c'est à moi de faire le premier pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Why do I have to start that?"
msgstr "Pourquoi c'est moi qui dois commencer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're talking like it's a two way street and I think you're right."
msgstr "Tu parles comme si ça marchait dans les deux sens, et je crois que t'as raison."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's not my obligation to be nice to everyone when most of them are assholes to me."
msgstr "J'ai aucune obligation d'être gentil avec tout le monde quand la plupart sont des connards avec moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look, I see where you're coming from, but is it always going to be someone else's responsibility?"
msgstr "Écoute, je comprends ton point de vue, mais est-ce que ce sera toujours aux autres de faire l'effort ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No wonder you're a loner, you're making this so complicated!"
msgstr "Pas étonnant que tu sois un solitaire, tu compliques tout !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, then how about you and I just be nice to each other and nevermind everybody else."
msgstr "Bon, alors si toi et moi, on était juste gentils l'un avec l'autre, et tant pis pour les autres ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not theirs any more than mine!"
msgstr "Pas plus à eux qu'à moi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not going to be some kind of social martyr and be nice to others on the off-chance they'll treat me well in return."
msgstr "Je vais pas jouer les martyrs sociaux en étant gentil avec les autres au cas où ils me traiteraient bien en retour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Talk about capital wasted."
msgstr "Tu parles d'un capital gaspillé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm fine on my own. I'm not lookin' to throw good attitude away hoping to \"make a friend.\""
msgstr "Je suis très bien tout seul. Je compte pas gaspiller ma bonne humeur dans l'espoir de « me faire un ami »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Making a friend isn't worth the effort?"
msgstr "Se faire un ami, ça ne vaut pas l'effort ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So why try, basically."
msgstr "Donc, en gros, pourquoi essayer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If I'm the only one trying, putting in the effort, no."
msgstr "Si je suis le seul à essayer, à faire des efforts, non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If that's always my job, that's not a friend."
msgstr "Si c'est toujours mon boulot, c'est pas un ami."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. I've never... thought about that."
msgstr "Ouah. Je n'avais jamais... pensé à ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're such a pessimist. I think maybe we just don't have a lot in common."
msgstr "T'es tellement pessimiste. Je crois qu'on n'a juste pas grand-chose en commun."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, think about it. Before you ask me, again, why I'm being \"disinterested.\""
msgstr "Ben, réfléchis-y. Avant de me redemander pourquoi je suis « pas intéressé »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Coulda told you that."
msgstr "J'aurais pu te le dire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you don't care?"
msgstr "Et ça t'est égal ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess I should've listened. Maybe we can just each do our own thing, then."
msgstr "J'aurais dû t'écouter. Chacun peut faire sa vie de son côté, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not really. I care that I'm me and you're you."
msgstr "Pas vraiment. Ce qui compte pour moi, c'est que je suis moi et que tu es toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm just not gonna stress out about us not being besties and riding off into the sunset."
msgstr "Je vais juste pas stresser parce qu'on est pas meilleurs potes à chevaucher ensemble vers le soleil couchant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's a waste of everyone's time."
msgstr "C'est une perte de temps pour tout le monde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's not waste any more time, then."
msgstr "Alors ne perdons plus de temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nothin' wrong with that. Kind of a pleasant way to be with each other, honestly."
msgstr "Y a rien de mal à ça. Plutôt une façon agréable d'être ensemble, franchement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No pressure."
msgstr "Aucune pression."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I can think you're a pessimist and we can still be cool?"
msgstr "Donc je peux te trouver pessimiste et on peut quand même être cool ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just bring you trash, and you'll take it, and we can be ok?"
msgstr "Je t'apporte juste des ordures, tu les prends, et ça roule entre nous ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Exactly. You do what you do. I'll do what I do."
msgstr "Exactement. Tu fais ce que tu fais. Je fais ce que je fais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And what you think of me doesn't change what I am."
msgstr "Et ce que tu penses de moi change pas ce que je suis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-0/39/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-1/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So... think whatever the hell you want."
msgstr "Alors... pense ce que tu veux, bordel."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, YOU are!"
msgstr "Non, c'est TOI qui l'es !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're trying to tell me that it's my responsibility to be nice to others on the off chance that they'll be put off by me..."
msgstr "T'essaies de me dire que c'est ma responsabilité d'être gentil avec les autres au cas où je les rebuterais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's somehow my job to apologize and fall all over myself trying not to upset anybody with my personality and I'm telling you..."
msgstr "Que c'est à moi, je sais pas comment, de m'excuser et de me mettre en quatre pour pas froisser qui que ce soit avec ma personnalité, et moi je te dis..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/34
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "BULL."
msgstr "FOUTAISES."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man... is that what I'm saying?"
msgstr "Oh, mince... c'est ce que je dis ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're making it sound bad. I just mean it's an easier way to be social."
msgstr "Tu le fais paraître pire que ça. Je veux juste dire que c'est une façon plus facile d'être sociable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Kinda. It's... insulting, but more importantly, it's not a way to live."
msgstr "Un peu. C'est... insultant, mais surtout, c'est pas une façon de vivre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nobody should have to do that. And when they do, all they're doing is putting this fake, apologetic version of themselves out into the world."
msgstr "Personne devrait avoir à faire ça. Et quand les gens le font, tout ce qu'ils font, c'est montrer au monde une version fausse et pleine d'excuses d'eux-mêmes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sooner or later, that falls apart. And then you find that the people around you don't know who you really are."
msgstr "Tôt ou tard, ça s'effondre. Et là, tu découvres que les gens autour de toi savent pas qui t'es vraiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe you don't even know who you really are."
msgstr "Peut-être que toi-même, tu sais pas qui t'es vraiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...you're really smart, Cam."
msgstr "... t'es vraiment intelligent, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. Sounds like you're just trying to rationalize being a jerk sometimes."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas. On dirait que tu essaies juste de justifier le fait d'être un con, parfois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever. If you didn't want friends, why did you talk to me at all?"
msgstr "Peu importe. Si tu ne voulais pas d'amis, pourquoi tu m'as parlé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "At least you didn't sound shocked that time."
msgstr "Au moins, t'avais pas l'air {{choqué|choquée|choqué·e}}, cette fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha. Yeah. Starting to get you a little more."
msgstr "Ha. Ouais. Je commence à un peu mieux te comprendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm definitely shocked. I think you like that I'm shocked."
msgstr "Non, je suis carrément {{choqué|choquée|choqué·e}}. Je crois que ça te plaît, que je sois {{choqué|choquée|choqué·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not all that complex."
msgstr "Je suis pas si compliqué que ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just pay attention, is all."
msgstr "Fais attention, c'est tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think most of us are like that. We'll tell you who we are. All you have to do is listen."
msgstr "Je crois que la plupart d'entre nous sont comme ça. On te dit qui on est. T'as juste à écouter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There you go again. Smart."
msgstr "Et voilà, ça recommence. Intelligent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I'm listening now. And I like what I hear."
msgstr "Eh bien, là, j'écoute. Et ce que j'entends me plaît."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. You're starting to sound like one of those inspirational tea bags."
msgstr "Haha. Tu commences à parler comme un de ces sachets de thé inspirants."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah yeah yeah. Careful. My ego's plenty healthy."
msgstr "Ouais, ouais, ouais. Attention. Mon ego se porte très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...um sure. I... are you hitting on me?"
msgstr "... euh, d'accord. Je... tu me dragues ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmmmm or am I?"
msgstr "Hmmmm, ou pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh gee, I wonder, what could I be doing..."
msgstr "Oh, mince, je me demande bien ce que je pourrais être en train de faire..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just tell me."
msgstr "Dis-le-moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't handle teasing well, do you?"
msgstr "Tu ne supportes pas bien qu'on te taquine, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, Cam. You're attractive. I'm hitting on you."
msgstr "Oui, Cam. Tu es attirant. Je te drague."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you threw away fewer used tea bags, I probably wouldn't sound that way, now would I?"
msgstr "Si tu jetais moins de sachets de thé usagés, je parlerais sûrement pas comme ça, pas vrai ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Anyway, they're kinda wise. What's wrong with taking in some herbal wisdom."
msgstr "Bref, ils sont plutôt sages. Quel mal y a-t-il à absorber un peu de sagesse en infusion."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing. I like it, actually. I like talking to you."
msgstr "Aucun. J'aime bien, en fait. J'aime bien te parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not exactly original. But it's cool."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas très original. Mais c'est cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well. Maybe."
msgstr "Bon. Peut-être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So I like to get a rise out of people sometimes."
msgstr "Donc j'aime bien faire réagir les gens, parfois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I never said I was an angel."
msgstr "J'ai jamais dit que j'étais un ange."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't like you so much if you were."
msgstr "Je ne t'aimerais pas autant si tu en étais un."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Devils are sexier anyway."
msgstr "Les démons sont plus sexy, de toute façon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-0/23/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Say what?"
msgstr "Pardon ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So what's the problem?"
msgstr "Alors c'est quoi, le problème ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Even if that's what I'm doing, who cares? You don't have to get it. You don't have to agree."
msgstr "Même si c'est ce que je fais, qu'est-ce que ça peut faire ? T'es pas {{obligé|obligée|obligé·e}} de comprendre. T'es pas {{obligé|obligée|obligé·e}} d'être d'accord."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not trying to convince you of anything."
msgstr "J'essaie de te convaincre de rien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you can't just go around being a jerk!"
msgstr "Mais tu ne peux pas te balader en étant con avec tout le monde !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, that's good because I'm not convinced at all."
msgstr "Eh bien, tant mieux, parce que je ne suis pas du tout {{convaincu|convaincue|convaincu·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Let's just agree that we're not gonna agree on this. How 'bout that."
msgstr "Mettons-nous d'accord sur le fait qu'on sera pas d'accord là-dessus. Ça te va ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You think I'm a deluded jerk, and I think you're kind of a pushy fixer."
msgstr "Tu me prends pour un con qui se fait des illusions, et moi je te trouve un peu {{lourd|lourde|lourd·e}} avec ta manie de tout réparer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's not required that we like each other."
msgstr "On est pas obligés de s'apprécier."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, it's not. But I'd like at least to understand you."
msgstr "Non, c'est vrai. Mais j'aimerais au moins te comprendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine. I guess you'll do you and I'll do me and that'll be it."
msgstr "Très bien. Chacun vivra sa vie de son côté, et puis c'est tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All I've done is be nice to you. How dare you call me pushy."
msgstr "Je n'ai fait qu'être {{gentil|gentille|gentil·le}} avec toi. Comment oses-tu me traiter de {{lourd|lourde|lourd·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Can't I just be a deluded jerk?"
msgstr "Je peux pas juste être un con qui se fait des illusions ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe you were right the first time."
msgstr "T'avais peut-être raison la première fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Know what? Maybe I was."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi ? Peut-être bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Possibly. I also just like you, and I think I can do better."
msgstr "Peut-être. Mais je t'aime bien, aussi, et je pense pouvoir faire mieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not hard, is it."
msgstr "C'est pas dur, hein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope, not really. Later."
msgstr "Non, pas vraiment. À plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. Makes sense, I guess. We can just... each be ourselves."
msgstr "Non. Ça se tient, j'imagine. On peut juste... être nous-mêmes, chacun de notre côté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Exactly. Who knows. You might enjoy it."
msgstr "Exactement. Qui sait. Ça pourrait te plaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pushy and touchy, apparently."
msgstr "{{Lourd|Lourde|Lourd·e}} et susceptible, apparemment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-1/31/g-0/24/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No fun to be cavalierly misunderstood, is it?"
msgstr "C'est pas drôle d'être incompris à la légère, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Mostly because you wouldn't shut up and just leave me alone."
msgstr "Surtout parce que tu voulais pas la fermer et me laisser tranquille."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Plus we did have a little bit of fun."
msgstr "Et puis on s'est quand même un peu amusés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just because we can't see eye-to-lid on stuff doesn't mean we have to hate each other."
msgstr "C'est pas parce qu'on voit pas les choses du même couvercle qu'on doit se détester."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah. I think I'm done."
msgstr "Non. Je crois que j'en ai fini."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "True, I guess. We can just go our separate ways."
msgstr "C'est vrai, j'imagine. On peut chacun suivre notre chemin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-0/39/c-2/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We did have some fun, didn't we."
msgstr "On s'est quand même bien amusés, hein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And what I'm trying to tell you is that I don't care about being social."
msgstr "Et ce que j'essaie de te dire, c'est que la vie sociale, je m'en fiche."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I just want to be me, and do my things, my way."
msgstr "Je veux juste être moi, et faire mes trucs, à ma façon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's enough for me."
msgstr "Ça me suffit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure you're not lonely?"
msgstr "Tu es sûr de ne pas te sentir seul ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine. You just want to do whatever you want, fine."
msgstr "Très bien. Tu veux juste faire ce que tu veux, très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pretty darn, yeah."
msgstr "Plutôt sûr, ouais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "Attends."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Is that why you're talking to me?"
msgstr "C'est pour ça que tu me parles ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You pity me?"
msgstr "Je te fais pitié ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...no, no, not at all..."
msgstr "... non, non, pas du tout..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, maybe? Your life seems a little... sad."
msgstr "Eh bien, peut-être ? Ta vie a l'air un peu... triste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Holy..."
msgstr "Nom de..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/39/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Get out. We're done."
msgstr "Dehors. On a fini."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-0/39/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Are you kidding me?"
msgstr "Tu te fous de moi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "God, now YOU'RE making a normal thing sound bad."
msgstr "Bon sang, maintenant c'est TOI qui fais passer un truc normal pour un truc mal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "YES, I want to live my life my way."
msgstr "OUI, je veux vivre ma vie à ma façon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That sounds pretty psychologically healthy to me!"
msgstr "Ça me paraît plutôt sain, psychologiquement !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What is your freaking problem."
msgstr "C'est quoi, ton foutu problème."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No problem. All good. You do you. It's nuts, but whatever."
msgstr "Aucun problème. Tout va bien. Fais comme tu le sens. C'est dingue, mais peu importe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-1/42/c-1/31/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right. I'M the one with the problem. As you hang out alone in a literal dump with a bad attitude."
msgstr "T'as raison. C'est MOI qui ai un problème. Pendant que tu traînes tout seul dans une décharge littérale, avec une sale attitude."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. Duh. Exactly."
msgstr "Pff. Évidemment. Exactement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "As long as you're cool with my version of nice."
msgstr "Tant que ma version de la gentillesse te va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You are, right?"
msgstr "Elle te va, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your \"version\"?"
msgstr "Ta « version » ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Totally."
msgstr "Ouais. Complètement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For god's sake, why can't you just be nice, why are you qualifying this."
msgstr "Bon sang, pourquoi tu ne peux pas juste être gentil, pourquoi tu poses des conditions."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. Salty. Snarky. Short."
msgstr "Ouais. Aigri. Sarcastique. Sec."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I mean, let's face it."
msgstr "Enfin, soyons honnêtes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm probably never gonna wanna curl up on the couch and watch a romcom with you."
msgstr "J'aurai sûrement jamais envie de me pelotonner sur le canapé pour regarder une comédie romantique avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's fine. More of an action fan anyway."
msgstr "Ça me va. Je suis plutôt films d'action, de toute façon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Romcom, blech. Bring on the scifi, baby."
msgstr "Les comédies romantiques, beurk. Envoie la science-fiction, chéri."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, as long as we can do docuseries marathons, I'm fine."
msgstr "Hé, tant qu'on peut faire des marathons de séries documentaires, ça me va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, let me be clear."
msgstr "Non, soyons clairs."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I will never want to curl up on the couch and watch ANYTHING."
msgstr "J'aurai jamais envie de me pelotonner sur le canapé pour regarder QUOI QUE CE SOIT."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't curl, I don't use couches, TV is dumb."
msgstr "Je me pelotonne pas, j'utilise pas de canapé, la télé, c'est débile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So my version of nice would be... non-couch related activities."
msgstr "Donc ma version de la gentillesse, ce serait... des activités sans rapport avec un canapé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, there goes making out."
msgstr "Bon, adieu les galoches, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So we'll stick to a daily exchange of trash and some quality sarcasm."
msgstr "Donc on s'en tient à un échange quotidien d'ordures et à du sarcasme de qualité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...wait, what?"
msgstr "... attends, quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Making out. Swappin' spit. Tonguin' with a trashy boi."
msgstr "Les galoches. Échanger de la salive. Rouler des pelles à un bad boy des poubelles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kissing someone you're attracted to? Couch is a popular locale for that."
msgstr "Embrasser quelqu'un qui t'attire ? Le canapé, c'est un endroit populaire pour ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think you jumped over a coupla gears there, drag racer."
msgstr "Je crois que t'as sauté deux ou trois vitesses, là, pilote de dragster."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Where did you get the idea I was attracted to you?"
msgstr "Où t'es allé{{|e|·e}} chercher que tu m'attirais ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We have a pretty killer banter, don't you think?"
msgstr "On a une répartie d'enfer, tu ne trouves pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm attracted to YOU. I figured with you, I'd be better off just admitting it straight out."
msgstr "C'est TOI qui m'attires. Je me suis dit qu'avec toi, valait mieux l'avouer franchement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That doesn't mean we're gonna make out all of a sudden."
msgstr "Ça veut pas dire qu'on va se rouler des pelles d'un coup."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're a granola bar."
msgstr "T'es comme une barre de céréales : {{plein|pleine|plein·e}} de noix."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "The last time we talked I chewed your head off, deservedly, and now you've decided you want to drag me out behind the dumpster and make an honest can outta me?"
msgstr "La dernière fois qu'on s'est parlé, je t'ai arraché la tête, à juste titre, et maintenant t'as décidé de me traîner derrière la benne pour faire de moi une poubelle honnête ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sheesh. And people think I have weird-ass social habits."
msgstr "Bon sang. Et les gens pensent que c'est moi qui ai des habitudes sociales chelous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Weird, maybe. But is it working?"
msgstr "Chelou, peut-être. Mais est-ce que ça marche ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're both weird. Maybe that's why I like you."
msgstr "On est bizarres tous les deux. C'est peut-être pour ça que je t'aime bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/32/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "That's new."
msgstr "Ça, c'est nouveau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/32/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I... like you."
msgstr "Je... t'aime bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-0/15/g-0/16/g-0/32/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Damn. Unexpected."
msgstr "Merde. Inattendu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-0/31/g-0/32/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Works for me, Cam."
msgstr "Ça me va, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. I think part of me expected you to say no."
msgstr "Tiens. Je crois qu'une partie de moi s'attendait à ce que tu dises non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So... are we just friends? Did that just happen?"
msgstr "Alors... on est juste amis ? C'est ce qui vient de se passer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. I guess so. Looks like we're both surprised."
msgstr "Haha. On dirait. On a l'air aussi surpris l'un que l'autre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't get too excited. You'll ruin it."
msgstr "Ne t'emballe pas trop. Tu vas tout gâcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-1/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Fair point. Ok. Friends, then. But it's no big deal."
msgstr "Bien vu. OK. Amis, alors. Mais c'est pas un truc énorme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Because I want to be clear. And I want you to be clear."
msgstr "Parce que je veux être clair. Et je veux que toi, tu sois clair{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Getting to the point. Clarity. Remember?"
msgstr "Aller droit au but. La clarté. Tu te souviens ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know what, no. Nevermind. I'm tired of trying to break down your walls."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi, non. Laisse tomber. J'en ai marre d'essayer de faire tomber tes murs."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I remember. Ok. I'm cool with you being exactly who you are."
msgstr "Ouais, je me souviens. OK. Ça me va que tu sois exactement qui tu es."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Then... we're good. I guess."
msgstr "Alors... ça roule. J'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Weird. I don't know that I've ever had a friend."
msgstr "Bizarre. Je crois pas avoir déjà eu un ami."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh shit, now I'm really sorry I said that."
msgstr "Oh merde, là je regrette vraiment d'avoir dit ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-2/39/c-2/31/c-2/23/c-1/34
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you throw that in my face, I'll dredge your toothbrush in the stuff that collects in the corners of one of my bags when it's full."
msgstr "Si tu me renvoies ça à la figure, je trempe ta brosse à dents dans le truc qui s'accumule dans les coins d'un de mes sacs quand il est plein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh yeah? Noticing the dig there..."
msgstr "Ah ouais ? Je remarque la petite pique..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What was I right about?"
msgstr "J'avais raison à propos de quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was trying to fix you."
msgstr "J'essayais de te réparer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was acting like a jerk."
msgstr "Je me comportais comme {{un con|une conne|un·e con·ne}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I can be controlling."
msgstr "Je crois que je peux être un peu dirigiste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah. Well."
msgstr "Ouais. Bon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nobody's perfect, I guess."
msgstr "Personne est parfait, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm trying to apologize here."
msgstr "J'essaie de m'excuser, là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that... that's all you have to say?"
msgstr "C'est... c'est tout ce que tu as à dire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'm not..."
msgstr "Je suis pas..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't get a lot of apologies."
msgstr "On me fait pas souvent d'excuses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Don't generally ask for them, either. So."
msgstr "J'en demande pas souvent non plus, d'ailleurs. Alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This is weird."
msgstr "C'est bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha! Nice to see you on the back foot, for once."
msgstr "Ha ! Ça fait plaisir de te voir sur la défensive, pour une fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll get used to it. Or maybe I'll be unique, who knows."
msgstr "Tu vas t'y habituer. Ou alors je serai unique, qui sait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, well, don't get used to it."
msgstr "Ouais, ben, t'y habitue pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'll recover from the shock and be back to my old snarky self in no time."
msgstr "Je vais me remettre du choc et redevenir mon vieux moi sarcastique en un rien de temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm counting on it. I... I kinda like your snarky self."
msgstr "J'y compte bien. Je... j'aime bien ton côté sarcastique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'd better be. If we're going to be friends, we've both gotta keep it interesting."
msgstr "T'as intérêt. Si on doit être amis, il faut qu'on garde tous les deux les choses intéressantes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You what?"
msgstr "Tu quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you. Sorry, how could I be more clear about that."
msgstr "Je t'aime bien. Pardon, comment je pourrais être plus {{clair|claire|clair·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're definitely unique. And weird."
msgstr "T'es vraiment unique. Et bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Those are good things, though. I'm unique and weird."
msgstr "Mais c'est des bonnes choses. Je suis unique et bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trust me, I noticed. Looking forward to being your friend."
msgstr "Crois-moi, j'avais remarqué. J'ai hâte d'être {{ton ami|ton amie|ton ami·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes, you are. I love it."
msgstr "Carrément, tu l'es. J'adore ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "My what?"
msgstr "Mon quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your friend. Kinda thought we could be friends."
msgstr "{{Ton ami|Ton amie|Ton ami·e}}. Je pensais qu'on pourrait être amis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, just try it. Might be fun."
msgstr "Allez, essaie, juste. Ça pourrait être sympa."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I think you mean you find the weirdness stimulating."
msgstr "Je crois que tu veux dire que la bizarrerie te stimule."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Fun to think about. Diverting."
msgstr "Sympa à méditer. Distrayant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Pretty sure you don't mean \"love.\""
msgstr "Je suis à peu près sûr que tu veux pas dire « adorer »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm pretty sure I do."
msgstr "Je suis à peu près {{sûr|sûre|sûr·e}} que si."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would it be so bad if I loved you?"
msgstr "Ce serait si terrible, si je t'aimais ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It would be really weird if you loved me."
msgstr "Ce serait vraiment bizarre, si tu m'aimais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Not cuz I don't deserve it, or anything. This isn't therapy. Just cuz..."
msgstr "Pas parce que je le mérite pas, ou quoi. C'est pas une thérapie. Juste parce que..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't know, just because..."
msgstr "J'sais pas, juste parce que..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Know what, we don't have to analyze it right now."
msgstr "Tu sais quoi, on n'est pas obligés d'analyser ça maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand. Might be weird if you loved me, too."
msgstr "Je comprends. Ce serait peut-être bizarre que tu m'aimes, toi aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I guess it's unfamiliar. Which isn't necessarily bad. Just weird. Just new."
msgstr "J'imagine que c'est pas familier. Ce qui est pas forcément mal. Juste bizarre. Juste nouveau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have been told I'm hot, though. So maybe it makes sense."
msgstr "Mais on m'a déjà dit que j'étais sexy. Alors ça se tient peut-être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah you are. But it's not just that."
msgstr "Oh que oui, tu l'es. Mais ce n'est pas que ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-1/23/g-0/16/g-0/32/c-1/23/c-1/34/g-0/24/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Careful, Cam. You might make me love you more."
msgstr "Attention, Cam. Tu pourrais me faire t'aimer encore plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's just a phrase. For when something's unlikely?"
msgstr "C'est juste une expression. Pour dire qu'un truc est peu probable ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It was as likely that you'd come back here as it is that a pig would learn to fly?"
msgstr "Que tu reviennes ici, c'était aussi probable qu'un cochon qui apprend à voler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You've really never heard that."
msgstr "T'as vraiment jamais entendu ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I haven't."
msgstr "Non, jamais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why is it so unlikely I'd come back?"
msgstr "Pourquoi c'est si peu probable que je revienne ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, I pretty much bodyslammed you the last time we talked. Most people would decide that casual friendliness with a trash can wasn't worth a verbal ass-whooping."
msgstr "Ben, je t'ai quasiment mis au tapis la dernière fois qu'on s'est parlé. La plupart des gens décideraient qu'une petite relation amicale avec une poubelle vaut pas une raclée verbale."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So why are you here."
msgstr "Alors pourquoi t'es là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because I was wrong. And I'm sorry."
msgstr "Parce que j'avais tort. Et je suis {{désolé|désolée|désolé·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because my ass kinda liked the whooping."
msgstr "Parce que mon cul a plutôt aimé la raclée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because I still need to throw stuff away, and I figured you'd be a pill about it if I didn't come back here and pretend to be contrite."
msgstr "Parce que j'ai toujours des trucs à jeter, et je me suis dit que tu ferais ta mauvaise tête si je ne revenais pas faire semblant d'être {{contrit|contrite|contrit·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And that just got said."
msgstr "Et ça, c'est dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Guess \"casual friendliness\" ain't really what you're after."
msgstr "J'imagine qu'une « petite relation amicale », c'est pas vraiment ce que tu cherches."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really, no. I totally dug how powerful you were."
msgstr "Pas vraiment, non. J'ai trop kiffé ta puissance."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can be friendly, too... but I really like you."
msgstr "On peut aussi être amis... mais je t'aime vraiment bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well you get points for honesty."
msgstr "Bon, tu gagnes des points pour l'honnêteté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I won't be a pill. I want the trash, you have the trash, give it to me freely."
msgstr "Je ferai pas ma mauvaise tête. Je veux les ordures, t'as les ordures, donne-les-moi librement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/20
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And don't worry about \"buttering me up\" in the future."
msgstr "Et t'embête pas à « me passer de la pommade » à l'avenir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_fight_encounter/0/c-2/31/g-0/16/c-2/25
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I have even less need of your friendship than you seem to have of mine."
msgstr "J'ai encore moins besoin de ton amitié que t'as l'air d'avoir besoin de la mienne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I got dumped once."
msgstr "Je me suis fait larguer, une fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah yeah yeah, a trash can getting dumped. I've heard it before, save your breath."
msgstr "Ouais, ouais, ouais, une poubelle qui se fait jeter. On me l'a déjà faite, économise ta salive."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was bummed. Broken heart, wanted them back. I was a little pathetic about it, begging and wondering what I did wrong. I was going back and forth between crying about it and hating them so much."
msgstr "J'étais dégoûté. Le coeur brisé, je voulais qu'on se remette ensemble. J'étais un peu pathétique, à supplier et à me demander ce que j'avais fait de mal. Je passais mon temps à pleurer et à détester cette personne à mort."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Took up a lot of my energy. For a while, actually."
msgstr "Ça m'a pris beaucoup d'énergie. Pendant un bon moment, même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But then Abel gave me some really great perspective on it."
msgstr "Mais après, Abel m'a donné un super recul sur tout ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Wanna hear it?"
msgstr "Tu veux l'entendre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Couldn't care less."
msgstr "Je m'en fiche complètement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh fine, what the hell."
msgstr "Oh, d'accord, qu'est-ce que ça peut faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "He told me to be really grateful to them. For dumping me. For being an asshole to me the whole time we were together."
msgstr "Il m'a dit d'être vraiment reconnaissant envers cette personne. De m'avoir largué. D'avoir été une ordure avec moi pendant tout le temps où on était ensemble."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I didn't get it. How could I be grateful? Why should I be grateful?"
msgstr "J'ai pas compris. Comment je pouvais être reconnaissant ? Pourquoi je devrais être reconnaissant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And Abel told me that they had actually done me a huge favor."
msgstr "Et Abel m'a dit qu'en fait, cette personne m'avait rendu un énorme service."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "They'd made it unavoidably clear that I didn't have to spend one more minute thinking about them, worrying about what they thought, caring about how they felt."
msgstr "Elle m'avait fait comprendre, sans ambiguïté possible, que j'avais plus à passer une minute de plus à penser à elle, à m'inquiéter de ce qu'elle pensait, à me soucier de ce qu'elle ressentait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was done. I was free."
msgstr "C'était fini. J'étais libre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I've been done and free ever since."
msgstr "Et depuis, c'est fini et je suis libre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You've done me that same favor all over again. Thank you."
msgstr "Tu viens de me rendre exactement le même service. Merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I'd say I hope you have a great day..."
msgstr "Je dirais bien que je te souhaite une bonne journée..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But I don't care anymore."
msgstr "Mais je m'en fiche, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/109
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I've seen that technique - the dumpee taking the high road."
msgstr "Je connais cette technique : la personne larguée qui prend de la hauteur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate/0/g-0/117
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Feel bad, until you remember they're literal trash."
msgstr "On se sent mal, jusqu'à ce qu'on se rappelle que ce sont littéralement des ordures."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Y'know, I've been thinking about our fight."
msgstr "Tu sais, j'ai repensé à notre dispute."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fight? More like you kinda blindsiding me."
msgstr "Une dispute ? C'était plutôt toi qui me tombais dessus sans prévenir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! That. No biggie."
msgstr "Oh ! Ça. Pas grave."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I have, too."
msgstr "Ouais, moi aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I wanted to say..."
msgstr "Je voulais dire..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hmph. This is harder than I thought."
msgstr "Hmpf. C'est plus dur que je pensais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I wanted to say I'm... pretty impressed."
msgstr "Je voulais dire que je suis... plutôt impressionné."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Impressed. By what?"
msgstr "Impressionné. Par quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. That's nice of you to say."
msgstr "Ouah. C'est gentil de dire ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It takes guts to stand up for yourself."
msgstr "Faut des tripes pour se défendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Takes guts to admit you were wrong, to apologize."
msgstr "Faut des tripes pour admettre qu'on a eu tort, pour s'excuser."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "In my experience, anyway, that kinda courage is... rare."
msgstr "D'après mon expérience, en tout cas, ce genre de courage, c'est... rare."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate that, Cam."
msgstr "Ça me touche, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haven't always been brave. I guess I'm learning."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas toujours été {{courageux|courageuse|courageux·se}}. J'imagine que j'apprends."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A friend like you is worth a little risk."
msgstr "Un ami comme toi vaut bien de prendre un petit risque."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Anyway. We don't have to let it go to our heads or anything."
msgstr "Bref. On est pas obligés de prendre la grosse tête ou quoi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How would being friends go to our heads?"
msgstr "Comment être amis pourrait nous faire prendre la grosse tête ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I heard about this movie once where these two women went on a crazy road trip and then a killing spree and then they drove off a cliff holding hands."
msgstr "J'ai entendu parler d'un film, une fois, où deux femmes partaient pour un road trip complètement fou, puis une virée meurtrière, et puis elles se jetaient d'une falaise en voiture en se tenant la main."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And they were friends. So."
msgstr "Et elles étaient amies. Alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a pretty dark conclusion, Cam."
msgstr "C'est une conclusion plutôt sombre, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think them being friends was the only factor there."
msgstr "Je ne pense pas que leur amitié ait été le seul facteur, là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We can just stick to trash. And sarcasm."
msgstr "On peut s'en tenir aux ordures. Et au sarcasme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And appreciating each other sometimes."
msgstr "Et s'apprécier de temps en temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "This may come as a shock but... I don't have a lot of friends."
msgstr "Ça va peut-être te choquer, mais... j'ai pas beaucoup d'amis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I don't have a lot of practice because, frankly, I don't like... anybody."
msgstr "J'ai pas beaucoup d'entraînement parce que, franchement, j'aime... personne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I'm flattered, then."
msgstr "J'imagine que je suis {{flatté|flattée|flatté·e}}, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-4/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man, I don't either."
msgstr "Oh, mec, moi non plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So we'll keep it simple."
msgstr "Alors on va faire simple."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I can handle that."
msgstr "Ça, je peux gérer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. I have a friend."
msgstr "Tiens. J'ai un ami."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. And you have a bad-ass hat."
msgstr "Ouais. Et tu as un chapeau de ouf."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "For real?"
msgstr "Sérieux ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Just so you know, I never let anyone try my shit."
msgstr "Pour info, je laisse jamais personne essayer mes affaires."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/26
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But... you wanna try it?"
msgstr "Mais... tu veux l'essayer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes."
msgstr "Carrément."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm good."
msgstr "Non, ça va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I knew I liked you."
msgstr "Je savais bien que je t'aimais bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "We're friends now. Put on the fucking hat."
msgstr "On est amis, maintenant. Mets ce putain de chapeau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friendship/0/g-5/28/8/c-14/34/g-0/3
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You look good in yellow."
msgstr "Le jaune te va bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Huh. So this is a thing that's happening."
msgstr "Tiens. Donc c'est un truc qui est en train d'arriver."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I was gonna pour some cold expired milk on ya..."
msgstr "J'allais te verser du lait froid périmé dessus..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "But what the hell."
msgstr "Mais et puis merde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I know I'm hot, I might as well get something out of it."
msgstr "Je sais que je suis sexy, autant en profiter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are hot. You're my new favorite dumpster fire."
msgstr "Tu es sexy. Tu es ma nouvelle catastrophe préférée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it. Let's get trashy."
msgstr "Allons-y. Soyons cochons."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You are creative. I like that."
msgstr "T'es {{créatif|créative|créatif·ve}}. J'aime ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If you'd tried to pull that wordplay before..."
msgstr "Si t'avais tenté ce jeu de mots avant..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You would've gone off on me and called me an elitist?"
msgstr "Tu t'en serais pris à moi et tu m'aurais {{traité d'élitiste|traitée d'élitiste|traité·e d'élitiste}} ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't trust me before. How could you know I wasn't making fun?"
msgstr "Tu ne me faisais pas confiance, avant. Comment tu aurais pu savoir que je ne me moquais pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Exactly. But I guess you are making fun now, aren't you?"
msgstr "Exactement. Mais j'imagine que là, tu te moques, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Creating, fun."
msgstr "Tu crées, tu t'amuses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hey... whaddya say we find a quiet spot and see if I've got anything else fun hidden away in here?"
msgstr "Hé... qu'est-ce que tu dirais qu'on se trouve un coin tranquille pour voir si j'ai pas d'autres trucs amusants planqués là-dedans ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wham Bam, thank you, Cam..."
msgstr "Wham bam, merci Cam..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Haha... found this."
msgstr "Haha... j'ai trouvé ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam pulls out a positively ancient cucumber, a devilish glint in his brown eyes."
msgstr "Cam sort un concombre absolument antique, une lueur diabolique dans ses yeux bruns."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How old is it..."
msgstr "Il a quel âge..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He places the wrinkled cucumber to your lips, quieting you."
msgstr "Il pose le concombre ridé sur vos lèvres pour vous faire taire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love/0/g-1/28/c-4/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nononono shhhhhhh....."
msgstr "Nonononon chuuuuut....."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You have got to be kidding me."
msgstr "Tu te fous de moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I know... here I am again."
msgstr "Ouais, je sais... me revoilà."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? I have trash."
msgstr "Quoi ? J'ai des ordures."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look... I just wanted to say I'm sorry."
msgstr "Écoute... je voulais juste te dire que je suis {{désolé|désolée|désolé·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And I'm supposed to what, fall on my knees and thank the heavens for your presence?"
msgstr "Et je suis censé faire quoi, tomber à genoux et remercier le ciel de ta présence ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... I just thought maybe we could start again?"
msgstr "Non... je me disais juste qu'on pourrait peut-être recommencer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ha. Yeah, I don't think so."
msgstr "Ha. Ouais, je crois pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Peace out, Captain Trash-less."
msgstr "Ciao, Capitaine Sans-Ordures."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well then toss it over here and quit yammerin'."
msgstr "Bon ben balance-les par ici et arrête de jacasser."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's not getting any fresher in your hands, is it."
msgstr "Elles vont pas devenir plus fraîches dans tes mains, hein."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Feel like we've done this already."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression qu'on a déjà fait ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think we both got a little hot headed. (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr "Je crois qu'on s'est un peu emportés tous les deux. (UTILISER UN BONBON DE PRESTANCE)"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-2/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...yeah. Maybe. I do that."
msgstr "... ouais. Peut-être. Ça m'arrive."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-2/15/c-0/21
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. Ok ok. I guess we can try again."
msgstr "Pff. OK, OK. J'imagine qu'on peut réessayer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-2/15/c-0/29
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "There might be a teeny tiny part of you that's cool."
msgstr "Il y a peut-être une toute petite partie de toi qui est cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_hate_return/0/c-2/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Worth exploring."
msgstr "Qui vaut le coup d'être explorée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hey, buddy. You look almost as good as the last time I saw you."
msgstr "Salut, mon pote. T'as presque aussi bonne mine que la dernière fois que je t'ai vu{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ha-ha. You should be a comedian."
msgstr "Ha ha. Tu devrais faire humoriste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/9/s/0 cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Cam."
msgstr "Je suis {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}} à te Réaliser, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Y'know I tried it once. Apparently I stank up the club."
msgstr "Tu sais, j'ai essayé une fois. Paraît que j'ai fait un bide. Un bide-ordures."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...get it?"
msgstr "... t'as pigé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, Cam. I get it."
msgstr "Ouais, Cam. J'ai pigé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Sweet. You get it."
msgstr "Cool. T'as pigé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/18/b/1
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Anyway. That's a pretty fantastic red shirt. Or whatever."
msgstr "Bref. Elle est plutôt fantastique, ta chemise rouge. Ou peu importe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_friend_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "So goes your friendship with Cam."
msgstr "Ainsi va votre amitié avec Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well hello there, spicy."
msgstr "Tiens, bonjour, mon piment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Bring that fantastic red shirt over here. Imma take it off with my teeth."
msgstr "Ramène ta Fantastique Chemise Rouge par ici. J'vais te l'enlever avec les dents."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello yourself."
msgstr "Bonjour à toi aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooh. I like my new nickname."
msgstr "Oooh. J'aime bien mon nouveau surnom."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Back for some more trashy pleasures?"
msgstr "De retour pour d'autres plaisirs cochons ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I knew it. Once they get a taste of the can, they <i>CAN</i>'t stay away."
msgstr "Je le savais. Une fois qu'on a goûté à la benne, on <i>BÉNIT</i> le jour où on m'a trouvé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I did not expect that once I got to know you, you'd be such a dork."
msgstr "Je ne m'attendais pas à ce qu'une fois que je te connaîtrais, tu sois aussi ringard."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What's life without some surprises."
msgstr "C'est quoi, la vie, sans quelques surprises."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_return/0/g-0/16/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "So goes your love for Cam."
msgstr "Ainsi va votre amour pour Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Alright. Shoot."
msgstr "Bon. Vas-y."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're baiting me a little bit. You know that, right?"
msgstr "Tu me provoques un peu, là. Tu le sais, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like you're really used to people talking down to you."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression que tu as vraiment l'habitude que les gens te parlent de haut."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Maybe. And?"
msgstr "Peut-être. Et ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And... I'm not gonna rise to it."
msgstr "Et... je ne vais pas mordre à l'hameçon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you and I can get off on a better foot."
msgstr "Je pense que toi et moi, on peut repartir du bon pied."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Prove it."
msgstr "Prouve-le."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to tell you right now that I'm sorry."
msgstr "Je veux te dire tout de suite que je suis {{désolé|désolée|désolé·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_empathy/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just do it differently. I screwed up."
msgstr "Faisons les choses autrement. J'ai merdé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/3
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh. Um."
msgstr "Oh. Euh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/11
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's cool."
msgstr "C'est cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/19
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "No, I mean... no, it isn't cool, I mean that I get it."
msgstr "Non, je veux dire... non, c'est pas cool, je veux dire que je comprends."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/27
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "It's not ok, but, like, it's ok, now."
msgstr "C'est pas OK, mais, genre, c'est OK, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/35
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. I mean thanks."
msgstr "Pff. Je veux dire merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. You don't get apologized to a lot, do you?"
msgstr "Ouah. On ne s'excuse pas souvent auprès de toi, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you made a point. I'm pretty sure."
msgstr "Je crois que tu as marqué un point. J'en suis presque {{sûr|sûre|sûr·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Shut up."
msgstr "La ferme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're kinda sexy when you're grateful."
msgstr "Tu es plutôt sexy quand tu es reconnaissant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/apology/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shutting up. Thanks for being cool. I like talking to you."
msgstr "Je la ferme. Merci d'être cool. J'aime bien te parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr "Sérieux ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stone cold seriously."
msgstr "Sérieux comme la mort."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_join/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well yeah, not just yet, but soon. Gotta do some stuff first."
msgstr "Eh bien, oui, pas tout de suite, mais bientôt. Je dois d'abord faire deux ou trois trucs."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Way to set a can's lid a-flutter, chuckles."
msgstr "Tu sais faire palpiter le couvercle d'une poubelle, rayon de soleil."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well, we both know I'm not going anywhere so..."
msgstr "Bon, on sait tous les deux que je vais nulle part, alors..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_join/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Take your time, I guess."
msgstr "Prends ton temps, j'imagine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_unfurnished/0/19/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Well hell, what are we doing standing around talking about it?"
msgstr "Bon sang, qu'est-ce qu'on fait plantés là à en parler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_unfurnished/0/19/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Let's boogie."
msgstr "On y va."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crazy_cam_condition/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Uh, that memory lady is still here with me..."
msgstr "Euh, la dame aux souvenirs est toujours là avec moi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crazy_cam_condition/0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "If I go away - you'll never get to speak to her again. That okay?"
msgstr "Si je m'en vais, tu pourras plus jamais lui parler. Ça te va ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crazy_cam_condition/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep!"
msgstr "Ouaip !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/crazy_cam_condition/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, you're right. Lemme come back."
msgstr "Oh, tu as raison. Je reviendrai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "There you are. I'm not impatient or anything but, also, waiting blows. Are you ready?"
msgstr "Te voilà. Je suis pas impatient ni rien, mais attendre, ça craint. T'es {{prêt|prête|prêt·e}} ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep. And I have what it takes."
msgstr "Ouaip. Et j'ai ce qu'il faut."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... no. I'm... I'll just go and come back, like, in a little while."
msgstr "Euh... non. Je... je vais y aller et revenir, genre, dans un petit moment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Ugh. Ok."
msgstr "Pff. OK."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're turning into a real tease, just FYI."
msgstr "Tu deviens {{un vrai allumeur|une vraie allumeuse|un·e vrai·e allumeur·se}}, pour info."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh yes I am... do you like that?"
msgstr "Oh que oui... ça te plaît ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_return/0/c-1/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Nah."
msgstr "Non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "We're starting with the trash? Oh! Don't let him know I said that!"
msgstr "On commence par la poubelle ? Oh ! Ne lui dis pas que j'ai dit ça !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Cam! Let's see if this will get you excited!"
msgstr "Cam ! Voyons si ça va te mettre en émoi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a trash can, becomes...."
msgstr "L'énergie spectrale traverse vos Dateviators, et ce qui n'était qu'une simple poubelle devient..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Before you stands Cam, in all his human glory."
msgstr "Devant vous se tient Cam, dans toute sa gloire humaine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...mmhmm."
msgstr "... mmmh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He casually examines his feet, his legs, and his strong hands. His chiseled jawline flashes in the light and his deep, penetrating eyes radiate intrigue."
msgstr "Il examine nonchalamment ses pieds, ses jambes et ses mains puissantes. Sa mâchoire ciselée accroche la lumière et ses yeux profonds et pénétrants respirent le mystère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He may have been a garbage can, but he's become a true work of art."
msgstr "Il a peut-être été une poubelle, mais il est devenu une véritable oeuvre d'art."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/46
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "Hm."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you... are you happy?"
msgstr "Tu es... tu es content ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is it? This is your whole reaction?"
msgstr "C'est tout ? C'est toute ta réaction ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "You're a human, I've been seeing you a lot over the past freaking endless decade so it's not like I was unprepared."
msgstr "T'es un humain, je t'ai vu{{|e|·e}} un paquet de fois pendant cette foutue décennie sans fin, alors c'est pas comme si j'étais pas préparé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I exist. It's cool."
msgstr "J'existe. C'est cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What else do you want from me?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu veux de plus ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing, I guess. As long as you're happy!"
msgstr "Rien, j'imagine. Tant que tu es content !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Same ol' Cam. Kinda reassuring, actually!"
msgstr "Toujours le même Cam. C'est plutôt rassurant, en fait !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "So yeah. Still me. This body'll work just fine."
msgstr "Alors ouais. Toujours moi. Ce corps fera très bien l'affaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam begins gathering as much of the trash around him as he can; he's clearly ready to embark on his next adventure and with a brief nod, and an almost imperceptible (but it's there, dammit) smile, he turns to go."
msgstr "Cam commence à rassembler autant d'ordures que possible autour de lui ; il est clairement prêt à se lancer dans sa prochaine aventure. Avec un bref hochement de tête et un sourire presque imperceptible (mais il est là, bon sang), il se retourne pour partir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Catch you on the flip, Cam."
msgstr "À la prochaine, Cam."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_realized/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about all the burning sexual tension between us, Cam?"
msgstr "Et toute cette tension sexuelle brûlante entre nous, Cam ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "The wha... oh."
msgstr "La quoi... oh."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh, yeah. The tension. Sure."
msgstr "Ah, ouais. La tension. Bien sûr."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/19
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "What are you thinking?"
msgstr "Tu penses à quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm thinking wine, candles, escargot."
msgstr "Je pense vin, bougies, escargots."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely a riding crop and some high heeled boots."
msgstr "Une cravache et des cuissardes à talons, c'est sûr."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... buttsex?"
msgstr "Euh... de la sodomie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh hell yes."
msgstr "Oh, carrément."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Yeah, I can go for that. There is one significant thing I have now that I didn't have access to as a can so, let's take this sucker out for a test drive."
msgstr "Ouais, ça me tente bien. Y a un truc important que j'ai maintenant et que j'avais pas en tant que poubelle, alors allons faire un essai sur route avec cet engin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Oh also, shit. Hang on."
msgstr "Oh, et aussi, merde. Attends."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "I've got some great lube in here. I think it might have been some component of a thai take out meal at one point but damn is it... functional."
msgstr "J'ai un super lubrifiant là-dedans. Je crois que ça a fait partie d'un plat thaï à emporter à un moment, mais bon sang, qu'est-ce que c'est... efficace."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "And peanut flavored. So that's cool."
msgstr "Et goût cacahuète. Alors c'est cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_divert/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "While you manage to convince Cam to use lube he didn't find in the garbage, your time together is filthy nonetheless. But where Cam's love is dirty, the connection between you is pure."
msgstr "Vous parvenez à convaincre Cam d'utiliser un lubrifiant qui ne vient pas des ordures, mais votre moment ensemble n'en est pas moins crade. Car si l'amour de Cam est sale, le lien entre vous est pur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam strikes out on his own, and unlike so many of us entering the wider world, he has not one doubt about his purpose, his passion, and his final destination."
msgstr "Cam part de son côté et, contrairement à tant d'entre nous qui entrons dans le vaste monde, il n'a pas le moindre doute sur sa raison d'être, sa passion et sa destination finale."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/8
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Welcome to my kingdom, Chuckles!"
msgstr "Bienvenue dans mon royaume, rayon de soleil !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam has found himself as the undisputed monarch of the biggest dump in the county. There is trash of all sizes and varieties, from the basic household load to industrial waste and commercial grade refuse, to be handled only by the truly expert."
msgstr "Cam est devenu le monarque incontesté de la plus grande décharge du comté. On y trouve des ordures de toutes tailles et de toutes sortes, des simples déchets ménagers aux déchets industriels et commerciaux, que seuls les vrais experts peuvent traiter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam did not apply for this job. He simply strode in the chain link gate and took over, to the evident relief of the entire then-present staff."
msgstr "Cam n'a pas postulé pour ce poste. Il a simplement franchi le portail grillagé et pris les commandes, au soulagement manifeste de tout le personnel alors présent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When asked what his salary requirements were, Cam scoffed."
msgstr "Quand on lui a demandé ses prétentions salariales, Cam a ricané."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/43
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "Heh, I told him I didn't need some stupid paper check."
msgstr "Hé, je lui ai dit que j'avais pas besoin d'un chèque en papier débile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/51
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "There's plenty of money out there... for someone who knows where to look."
msgstr "Y a plein d'argent par ici... pour qui sait où chercher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: cam_trashcan/cam_love_join/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cam winked, and turned arms akimbo into the methane orange sunset over the chemical waste quadrant. For a man, formerly a can, to find his place, is truly a thing of beauty."
msgstr "Cam fait un clin d'oeil et, les poings sur les hanches, se tourne vers le coucher de soleil orange méthane qui embrase le secteur des déchets chimiques. Qu'un homme, autrefois poubelle, trouve sa place : voilà une chose vraiment magnifique."
